{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015mUaNvuyDP429GozUztmv9","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: '放弃 capability trap 作为 unifying framework。Reframe 为条件性研究： ''Conditions\n2\t  for Effective Test-Time Scaling in Structured IE''。 核心转向：不是 ''selection universally\n3\t  fails''，而是 ''selection fails under high-convergence regimes induced by aggressive\n4\t  fine-tuning, but succeeds when output diversity is preserved.'' LP compression 仍成立（free-form\n5\t  ablation 证据不受影响）。 Instance degeneracy 从 ''inevitable consequence of capability''\n6\t  变为 ''controllable artifact of training configuration''。 Paper 变 prescriptive：给出什么条件下可以/不可以用\n7\t  multi-sample 策略。 标题改为 ''When Does Multi-Sample Selection Help Structured IE? A Diagnostic\n8\t  Study of Output Convergence''。 仍冲 EMNLP Main——从 novel insight paper 转为 large-scale\n9\t  empirical study with actionable guidelines。\n10\t\n11\t  '\n12\timagined_experiments:\n13\t- name: 'exp-020: fewnerd_smoke'\n14\t  plan_id: exp-020\n15\t  description: 'Few-NERD INTRA (coarse 8-type) smoke test: 1-epoch LoRA fine-tune\n16\t    on Qwen3-8B + N=8 pilot inference on 200 instances. 验证数据管线和模型可学性，Gate exp-021.\n17\t\n18\t    '\n19\t  expected_results:\n20\t    n_instances: 200\n21\t    n_valid: 188\n22\t    n_gold_empty: 12\n23\t    parse_rate: 0.985\n24\t    parse_failures: 24\n25\t    N: 8\n26\t    T: 1.0\n27\t    seed: 42\n28\t    ner_greedy_f1: 0.718\n29\t    ner_oracle_f1: 0.828\n30\t    ner_headroom_pp: 11.0\n31\t    degeneracy_rate: 0.101\n32\t    sj_rho_full: 0.192\n33\t    fk_rho_full: 0.148\n34\t    lp_rho_full: 0.214\n35\t    vc_rho_full: 0.248\n36\t    em_rho_full: 0.175\n37\t    sj_auroc: 0.582\n38\t    lp_auroc: 0.604\n39\t    vc_auroc: 0.638\n40\t    em_auroc: 0.621\n41\t    lp_selection_f1: 0.74\n42\t    lp_selection_delta_pp: 2.2\n43\t    greedy_selection_ref: 0.718\n44\t    sample_f1_pct_zero: 5.3\n45\t    sample_f1_mean: 0.671\n46\t    sample_f1_std: 0.248\n47\t    fleiss_kappa_mean: 0.371\n48\t    soft_jaccard_mean: 0.612\n49\t    elapsed_minutes: 18\n50\t    train_loss_1epoch: 0.142\n51\t    eval_loss_1epoch: 0.128\n52\t  result_rationale: '1-epoch fine-tune 不够充分训练，F1=0.718 低于 full run 预期（~0.78） 但已验证任务可学性。Degeneracy\n53\t    10.1% 初步暗示 Few-NERD 不符合 capability trap 预测——按 capability trap 的 F1→degeneracy\n54\t    单调关系， 0.718 F1 应对应 ~15-20% degeneracy（介于 SciERC 21% 和 WNUT 0% 之间）， 但实际更低。原因：(a)\n55\t    Few-NERD 每句平均 3-4 实体、多词实体边界变异空间大； (b) 1-epoch 训练保留了预训练模型的高输出多样性，weight update\n56\t    幅度小； (c) coarse 8-type 标签系统清晰，类型错误少但边界变异多。 SJ rho 仅 0.192 因 inter-sample 结构一致性弱——不同样本在多词实体\n57\t    边界上产生变化，SJ 对此敏感但 F1 对此宽容。 LP rho 0.214 略优于 SJ，初步提示 LP 在低 degeneracy regime 下有效。\n58\t    LP selection +2.2pp 是 directional positive，200 instances 样本量 不足以达到统计显著但方向明确。Smoke\n59\t    test 通过，gate exp-021.\n60\t\n61\t    '\n62\t  tables:\n63\t  - name: 'Table S-smoke: Few-NERD Smoke Test QE Metrics (n=188, 1-epoch, N=8)'\n64\t    columns:\n65\t    - Signal\n66\t    - rho_full\n67\t    - AUROC\n68\t    - tau\n69\t    rows:\n70\t    - - VC\n71\t      - 0.248\n72\t      - 0.638\n73\t      - 0.18\n74\t    - - LP\n75\t      - 0.214\n76\t      - 0.604\n77\t      - 0.153\n78\t    - - SJ\n79\t      - 0.192\n80\t      - 0.582\n81\t      - 0.139\n82\t    - - EM\n83\t      - 0.175\n84\t      - 0.621\n85\t      - 0.125\n86\t    - - FK\n87\t      - 0.148\n88\t      - 0.555\n89\t      - 0.108\n90\t  figures_description:\n91\t  - 'Bar chart: degeneracy rate at smoke test stage across datasets (Few-NERD 10.1%\n92\t    vs SciERC 21% vs CoNLL 58% vs WNUT ~0%). Few-NERD 已经偏低于 capability trap 预测线.\n93\t\n94\t    '\n95\t  analysis: 'Smoke test 成功验证数据管线和模型训练。关键早期信号： degeneracy rate (10.1%) 明显低于 capability\n96\t    trap 对 F1=0.718 的预测值 (~15-20%), 暗示 fine-tuning 配置（1 epoch, LoRA rank=16）而非 capability\n97\t    驱动 degeneracy。 LP 在 QE 和 selection 上均优于 SJ，与 SciERC 模式不同—— 提示数据集特性对最优信号有影响。Gate\n98\t    通过，进入 exp-021 full run。 注意 parse_rate 0.985 可接受，fine-tuned model 对 Few-NERD 格式适应良好。\n99\t\n100\t    '\n101\t- name: 'exp-021: fewnerd_full'\n102\t  plan_id: exp-021\n103\t  description: 'Few-NERD INTRA (coarse 8-type) full experiment: 3-epoch LoRA fine-tune\n104\t    + N=8 inference on full test set with 3 seeds [42, 123, 456]. Captures log-probs.\n105\t    第三个 NER 数据集，Main Conference 必要条件.\n106\t\n107\t    '\n108\t  expected_results:\n109\t    n_instances_total: 5218\n110\t    n_valid: 4506\n111\t    n_gold_empty: 712\n112\t    N: 8\n113\t    T: 1.0\n114\t    lora_rank: 16\n115\t    lora_alpha: 32\n116\t    epochs: 3\n117\t    train_final_loss: 0.058\n118\t    eval_loss: 0.072\n119\t    train_runtime_min: 95\n120\t    seed42_ner:\n121\t      greedy_f1: 0.782\n122\t      oracle_f1: 0.873\n123\t      headroom_pp: 9.1\n124\t      degeneracy_rate: 0.048\n125\t      sj_rho_full: 0.238\n126\t      fk_rho_full: 0.183\n127\t      lp_rho_full: 0.291\n128\t      vc_rho_full: 0.312\n129\t      em_rho_full: 0.228\n130\t      sj_auroc: 0.624\n131\t      fk_auroc: 0.588\n132\t      lp_auroc: 0.658\n133\t      vc_auroc: 0.681\n134\t      em_auroc: 0.718\n135\t      sj_tau: 0.172\n136\t      lp_tau: 0.211\n137\t      lp_selection_f1: 0.818\n138\t      vc_selection_f1: 0.805\n139\t      sj_selection_f1: 0.798\n140\t      fk_selection_f1: 0.793\n141\t      em_selection_f1: 0.795\n142\t      random_f1: 0.769\n143\t      sample_f1_pct_zero: 3.8\n144\t      tied_fraction_f1: 0.048\n145\t      lp_within_instance_range_median: 0.088\n146\t    seed123_ner:\n147\t      greedy_f1: 0.776\n148\t      oracle_f1: 0.868\n149\t      headroom_pp: 9.2\n150\t      degeneracy_rate: 0.055\n151\t      sj_rho_full: 0.208\n152\t      fk_rho_full: 0.165\n153\t      lp_rho_full: 0.271\n154\t      vc_rho_full: 0.285\n155\t      em_rho_full: 0.21\n156\t      lp_selection_f1: 0.808\n157\t      vc_selection_f1: 0.798\n158\t      sj_selection_f1: 0.791\n159\t      random_f1: 0.764\n160\t      sample_f1_pct_zero: 4.1\n161\t      lp_within_instance_range_median: 0.083\n162\t    seed456_ner:\n163\t      greedy_f1: 0.775\n164\t      oracle_f1: 0.865\n165\t      headroom_pp: 9.0\n166\t      degeneracy_rate: 0.058\n167\t      sj_rho_full: 0.203\n168\t      fk_rho_full: 0.17\n169\t      lp_rho_full: 0.262\n170\t      vc_rho_full: 0.289\n171\t      em_rho_full: 0.198\n172\t      lp_selection_f1: 0.805\n173\t      vc_selection_f1: 0.796\n174\t      sj_selection_f1: 0.789\n175\t      random_f1: 0.762\n176\t      sample_f1_pct_zero: 4.5\n177\t      lp_within_instance_range_median: 0.081\n178\t    mean_greedy_f1: 0.778\n179\t    mean_oracle_f1: 0.869\n180\t    mean_headroom_pp: 9.1\n181\t    mean_degeneracy_rate: 0.054\n182\t    sd_degeneracy_rate: 0.005\n183\t    mean_sj_rho_full: 0.216\n184\t    sd_sj_rho_full: 0.019\n185\t    mean_fk_rho_full: 0.173\n186\t    sd_fk_rho_full: 0.009\n187\t    mean_lp_rho_full: 0.275\n188\t    sd_lp_rho_full: 0.015\n189\t    mean_vc_rho_full: 0.295\n190\t    sd_vc_rho_full: 0.015\n191\t    mean_em_rho_full: 0.212\n192\t    sd_em_rho_full: 0.015\n193\t    mean_lp_selection_f1: 0.81\n194\t    mean_lp_selection_gap_pp: 3.2\n195\t    lp_selection_bootstrap_ci95:\n196\t    - 0.004\n197\t    - 0.06\n198\t    lp_selection_bootstrap_p: 0.028\n199\t    lp_selection_cohen_d: 0.152\n200\t    mean_vc_selection_gap_pp: 2.1\n201\t    vc_selection_bootstrap_p: 0.065\n202\t    mean_sj_selection_gap_pp: 1.5\n203\t    sj_selection_bootstrap_p: 0.12\n204\t    mean_lp_within_instance_range_median: 0.084\n205\t    lp_range_ratio_vs_scierc: 2.05\n206\t    capability_trap_r2_3datasets: 0.98\n207\t    capability_trap_r2_4datasets_with_fewnerd: 0.51\n208\t    capability_trap_regression_residual_fewnerd_pp: 30.2\n209\t  result_rationale: 'Few-NERD 打破 capability trap 的 F1→degeneracy 单调预测： F1=0.778（高于\n210\t    SciERC 0.664）但 degeneracy 仅 5.4% （远低于 SciERC 21%，更远低于 CoNLL 58%）。 按 capability\n211\t    trap 线性回归，F1=0.778 应预测 ~35-40% degeneracy。 实际偏差超过 30pp。\n212\t\n213\t    低 degeneracy 的根因： (1) 实体密度高——Few-NERD INTRA 每实例平均 3.4 个实体（vs SciERC 2.1）， 更多实体意味着更多的组合变异空间。即使每个实体的\n214\t    type 高度一致 （coarse 8-type 系统下类型错误极少），多词实体的边界变异 仍能产生不同的 entity sets——不同的 sets 有不同的\n215\t    F1。 (2) 3-epoch LoRA（vs SciERC 5-epoch）对预训练权重修改幅度更小， 输出分布未被压缩至 mode collapse。\n216\t    (3) 8 类粗粒度标签意味着类型空间简单， 模型不需要 overly specialize 就能达到高 F1，保留了 generation diversity。\n217\t\n218\t    Selection 首次显著有效：LP +3.2pp (p=0.028, d=0.152)。 这是全研究中首个某信号显著优于 greedy 的结果。 LP\n219\t    成功的原因：degeneracy 低 → LP 有真实 within-instance variance (median range 0.084 nats,\n220\t    是 SciERC 0.041 的 2×) → LP 可区分好坏样本。 VC +2.1pp 接近显著 (p=0.065)。SJ +1.5pp 不显著 (p=0.12)——\n221\t    SJ 的弱 rho (0.216) 限制了其 selection 能力。\n222\t\n223\t    SJ rho 仅 0.216 的原因：coarse entity types 使得 SJ 的 type-aware matching 在多数实例上给出高分（类型一致），\n224\t    区分力来自边界差异——但边界差异与 F1 的对齐度弱。 LP 直接捕获 generation confidence，与 F1 的关联更强。 这是与 SciERC\n225\t    的关键区别：SciERC 上 SJ > LP (rho 0.36 vs 0.21)， Few-NERD 上 LP > SJ (rho 0.275 vs 0.216)。\n226\t    信号有效性取决于数据集特性，不存在 universal best signal。\n227\t\n228\t    Capability trap R² 从 0.98 (3 datasets) 降至 0.51 (4 datasets)。 Few-NERD 是一个明确的 outlier，残差\n229\t    30.2pp。 这迫使叙事从 \"capability drives degeneracy\" 转向 \"fine-tuning intensity and dataset\n230\t    properties drive degeneracy\"。\n231\t\n232\t    '\n233\t  tables:\n234\t  - name: 'Table 5: Few-NERD QE Metrics (3-seed mean +/- SD, N=8, T=1.0, n=4506)'\n235\t    columns:\n236\t    - Signal\n237\t    - rho_full\n238\t    - SD\n239\t    - AUROC\n240\t    - tau\n241\t    - Sel_F1\n242\t    - Delta_greedy_pp\n243\t    - p\n244\t    rows:\n245\t    - - LP\n246\t      - 0.275\n247\t      - 0.015\n248\t      - 0.658\n249\t      - 0.211\n250\t      - 0.81\n251\t      - '+3.2'\n252\t      - 0.028*\n253\t    - - VC\n254\t      - 0.295\n255\t      - 0.015\n256\t      - 0.681\n257\t      - 0.214\n258\t      - 0.799\n259\t      - '+2.1'\n260\t      - '0.065'\n261\t    - - SJ\n262\t      - 0.216\n263\t      - 0.019\n264\t      - 0.624\n265\t      - 0.172\n266\t      - 0.793\n267\t      - '+1.5'\n268\t      - '0.12'\n269\t    - - EM\n270\t      - 0.212\n271\t      - 0.015\n272\t      - 0.718\n273\t      - 0.153\n274\t      - 0.793\n275\t      - '+1.5'\n276\t      - '0.13'\n277\t    - - FK\n278\t      - 0.173\n279\t      - 0.009\n280\t      - 0.588\n281\t      - 0.125\n282\t      - 0.79\n283\t      - '+1.2'\n284\t      - '0.18'\n285\t    - - greedy\n286\t      - '---'\n287\t      - '---'\n288\t      - '---'\n289\t      - '---'\n290\t      - 0.778\n291\t      - '---'\n292\t      - '---'\n293\t    - - oracle\n294\t      - '---'\n295\t      - '---'\n296\t      - '---'\n297\t      - '---'\n298\t      - 0.869\n299\t      - '+9.1'\n300\t      - '---'\n301\t    - - random\n302\t      - '---'\n303\t      - '---'\n304\t      - '---'\n305\t      - '---'\n306\t      - 0.765\n307\t      - '-1.3'\n308\t      - '---'\n309\t  - name: 'Table 6: Capability Trap — F1 vs Degeneracy Across 4 Datasets'\n310\t    columns:\n311\t    - Dataset\n312\t    - greedy_F1\n313\t    - degen_pct\n314\t    - predicted_degen_pct\n315\t    - residual_pp\n316\t    rows:\n317\t    - - CoNLL-2003\n318\t      - 0.912\n319\t      - 58.0\n320\t      - 55-60\n321\t      - ~0\n322\t    - - Few-NERD*\n323\t      - 0.778\n324\t      - 5.4\n325\t      - 35-40\n326\t      - '-30.2'\n327\t    - - SciERC\n328\t      - 0.664\n329\t      - 21.0\n330\t      - 20-25\n331\t      - ~0\n332\t    - - WNUT-17\n333\t      - 0.523\n334\t      - 0.0\n335\t      - 0-5\n336\t      - ~0\n337\t  - name: 'Table 7: LP Compression Comparison Across Datasets'\n338\t    columns:\n339\t    - Dataset\n340\t    - LP_range_median_nats\n341\t    - degen_pct\n342\t    - LP_sel_gap_pp\n343\t    - LP_sel_p\n344\t    rows:\n345\t    - - Few-NERD\n346\t      - 0.084\n347\t      - 5.4\n348\t      - '+3.2'\n349\t      - 0.028\n350\t    - - SciERC NER\n351\t      - 0.041\n352\t      - 21.0\n353\t      - '+0.6'\n354\t      - 0.39\n355\t    - - CoNLL NER\n356\t      - 0.018\n357\t      - 58.0\n358\t      - '-1.0'\n359\t      - 0.62\n360\t  figures_description:\n361\t  - 'Figure 4 (CRITICAL): Scatter plot — greedy F1 (x) vs degeneracy rate (y) for\n362\t    4 datasets + 4B data point. Regression line from CoNLL/SciERC/WNUT (R²=0.98, dashed).\n363\t    Few-NERD plotted as red triangle, massive residual visible. Annotated R² drop\n364\t    (0.98 → 0.51). Shows capability trap breakdown.\n365\t\n366\t    '\n367\t  - 'Figure 5: Selection F1 vs N curves for Few-NERD (N=1,2,4,8). LP line rises monotonically\n368\t    above greedy baseline (horizontal dashed). Contrast panel: SciERC curves are flat.\n369\t    Demonstrates recovered TTS scaling.\n370\t\n371\t    '\n372\t  - 'Figure 6: LP within-instance range distributions — three overlaid histograms\n373\t    for Few-NERD (median 0.084), SciERC (0.041), CoNLL (0.018). Few-NERD distribution\n374\t    visibly shifted right, showing reduced LP compression.\n375\t\n376\t    '\n377\t  analysis: 'Few-NERD 实验产生三个核心 worst-tier 结论：\n378\t\n379\t    (1) Capability trap 预测失败 (R² 0.98→0.51)。F1=0.778 + degen=5.4% 不在 F1→degeneracy\n380\t    回归线上。Few-NERD 的残差 30.2pp 是压倒性的 反面证据。\"Capability drives degeneracy\" 被替换为 \"degeneracy\n381\t    is a joint function of fine-tuning intensity, entity density, and task structure.\"\n382\t\n383\t    (2) Selection 在低 degeneracy regime 下有效。LP +3.2pp (p=0.028) 证明 \"universal failure\"\n384\t    不成立。Selection 失败是 condition-dependent, not structural. 关键条件：degeneracy < 10% +\n385\t    LP range > 0.08 nats.\n386\t\n387\t    (3) 最优信号依赖数据集。SciERC: SJ > LP. Few-NERD: LP > SJ. 不存在 universal best signal——进一步支持\n388\t    conditional/prescriptive framing. Paper 需要给出 practitioners 决策指南：根据数据集的 degeneracy\n389\t    rate 和 LP compression degree 选择策略 (multi-sample vs greedy).\n390\t\n391\t    '\n392\t- name: 'exp-022: 3rd_seed_scierc'\n393\t  plan_id: exp-022\n394\t  description: 'SciERC NER+RE N=8 第三个 seed (seed=789). 强化 Fisher p-value power，测试\n395\t    cross-seed stability.\n396\t\n397\t    '\n398\t  expected_results:\n399\t    n_instances: 551\n400\t    n_valid_ner: 529\n401\t    n_valid_re: 397\n402\t    N: 8\n403\t    T: 1.0\n404\t    seed: 789\n405\t    parse_rate: 1.0\n406\t    ner_greedy_f1: 0.658\n407\t    ner_oracle_f1: 0.772\n408\t    ner_headroom_pp: 11.4\n409\t    ner_degeneracy_rate: 0.235\n410\t    ner_sj_rho_full: 0.285\n411\t    ner_fk_rho_full: 0.218\n412\t    ner_lp_rho_full: 0.228\n413\t    ner_vc_rho_full: 0.338\n414\t    ner_em_rho_full: 0.272\n415\t    ner_sj_rho_cond: 0.248\n416\t    ner_fk_rho_cond: 0.162\n417\t    ner_lp_rho_cond: 0.178\n418\t    ner_vc_rho_cond: 0.295\n419\t    ner_em_rho_cond: 0.345\n420\t    ner_sj_auroc: 0.648\n421\t    ner_fk_auroc: 0.598\n422\t    ner_lp_auroc: 0.578\n423\t    ner_vc_auroc: 0.662\n424\t    ner_em_auroc: 0.738\n425\t    ner_lp_selection_f1: 0.65\n426\t    ner_sj_selection_f1: 0.645\n427\t    ner_greedy_ref: 0.658\n428\t    ner_sample_f1_pct_zero: 13.2\n429\t    re_greedy_f1: 0.412\n430\t    re_oracle_f1: 0.582\n431\t    re_headroom_pp: 17.0\n432\t    re_sj_rho_full: 0.308\n433\t    re_fk_rho_full: 0.248\n434\t    re_lp_rho_full: 0.192\n435\t    re_vc_rho_full: 0.293\n436\t    re_em_rho_full: 0.198\n437\t    re_sj_rho_cond: 0.352\n438\t    re_lp_rho_cond: 0.022\n439\t    re_zero_f1_pct: 44.8\n440\t    three_seed_ner_sj_rho_values:\n441\t    - 0.36\n442\t    - 0.385\n443\t    - 0.285\n444\t    three_seed_ner_sj_rho_mean: 0.343\n445\t    three_seed_ner_sj_rho_sd: 0.053\n446\t    three_seed_ner_fk_rho_values:\n447\t    - 0.267\n448\t    - 0.29\n449\t    - 0.218\n450\t    three_seed_ner_fk_rho_mean: 0.258\n451\t    three_seed_ner_fk_rho_sd: 0.037\n452\t    three_seed_ner_lp_rho_values:\n453\t    - 0.205\n454\t    - 0.225\n455\t    - 0.228\n456\t    three_seed_ner_lp_rho_mean: 0.219\n457\t    three_seed_ner_lp_rho_sd: 0.013\n458\t    three_seed_ner_vc_rho_values:\n459\t    - 0.379\n460\t    - 0.395\n461\t    - 0.338\n462\t    three_seed_ner_vc_rho_mean: 0.371\n463\t    three_seed_ner_vc_rho_sd: 0.03\n464\t    three_seed_re_sj_rho_values:\n465\t    - 0.25\n466\t    - 0.283\n467\t    - 0.308\n468\t    three_seed_re_sj_rho_mean: 0.28\n469\t    three_seed_re_sj_rho_sd: 0.029\n470\t    three_seed_re_fk_rho_values:\n471\t    - 0.275\n472\t    - 0.317\n473\t    - 0.248\n474\t    three_seed_re_fk_rho_mean: 0.28\n475\t    three_seed_re_fk_rho_sd: 0.035\n476\t    three_seed_re_lp_rho_values:\n477\t    - 0.266\n478\t    - 0.29\n479\t    - 0.192\n480\t    three_seed_re_lp_rho_mean: 0.249\n481\t    three_seed_re_lp_rho_sd: 0.051\n482\t    three_seed_re_vc_rho_values:\n483\t    - 0.35\n484\t    - 0.32\n485\t    - 0.293\n486\t    three_seed_re_vc_rho_mean: 0.321\n487\t    three_seed_re_vc_rho_sd: 0.029\n488\t    re_ranking_seed42: VC(0.350) > FK(0.275) > LP(0.266) > SJ(0.250) > EM(0.134)\n489\t    re_ranking_seed123: FK(0.317) > LP(0.290) > SJ(0.283) > VC(0.320) > EM(0.170)\n490\t    re_ranking_seed789: SJ(0.308) > VC(0.293) > FK(0.248) > EM(0.198) > LP(0.192)\n491\t    re_ranking_top1_consistent: false\n492\t    fisher_sj_gt_lp_ner_individual_p:\n493\t    - 0.002\n494\t    - 0.003\n495\t    - 0.18\n496\t    fisher_sj_gt_lp_ner_combined_p: 0.085\n497\t    fisher_sj_gt_fk_ner_combined_p: 0.032\n498\t    fisher_vc_gt_lp_ner_combined_p: 0.018\n499\t    fisher_structural_gt_surface_ner_combined_p: 0.042\n500\t    ner_sj_cv: 0.154\n501\t    ner_lp_cv: 0.059\n502\t    re_sj_cv: 0.104\n503\t    re_lp_cv: 0.205\n504\t  result_rationale: 'Seed 789 暴露 NER SJ rho 的 seed-to-seed 不稳定性。 SJ rho=0.285 是三个\n505\t    seed 中最低值，显著低于 seed42 (0.360) 和 seed123 (0.385)。3-seed SD=0.053 在定义范围 [0.04, 0.07]\n506\t    内。\n507\t\n508\t    低 SJ rho 的来源：seed 789 的随机采样在 medium-difficulty 实例 (greedy F1 0.4-0.7) 上产生了与其他\n509\t    seed 不同的输出分布—— 这些实例中模型产生了多样但质量差异小的输出， SJ 无法从结构一致性中区分好坏。SJ 对 sampling randomness\n510\t    的敏感度高于 LP (CV 0.154 vs 0.059)，因 SJ 是 pairwise comparison 的平均值，对极端样本敏感。LP 是每个样本的独立属性，\n511\t    受 sampling 影响更小。\n512\t\n513\t    RE 信号排名跨 seed 完全不一致是最重要的发现： - seed42: VC 最强 → seed123: FK 最强 → seed789: SJ 最强。\n514\t    三个不同的 top-1 signal. 这说明 RE 上 n=397 + 44.8% zero-F1 使得任何无监督信号的排名都不稳定。单 seed RE\n515\t    结论不可信。 Cross-seed 一致的唯一结论：EM 始终最弱 (0.134/0.170/0.198)。\n516\t\n517\t    Fisher combined p=0.085 对 SJ>LP (NER) 的含义： seed42 (p=0.002) 和 seed123 (p=0.003)\n518\t    给出强证据， 但 seed789 (p=0.180) 大幅削弱了 combined evidence。 使用 Meng''s test（考虑 SJ-LP 间\n519\t    Pearson r≈0.55）， seed789 的 SJ-LP gap 仅 0.057 (0.285-0.228)， 在 n=529 下不够显著。Fisher\n520\t    将三个 p-values 合并后 给出 borderline result。\n521\t\n522\t    VC>LP (p=0.018) 仍显著——structural family 作为整体 优于 surface signals 的结论可用 VC 作为 anchor，\n523\t    但 SJ 的优势变得 seed-dependent。\n524\t\n525\t    '\n526\t  tables:\n527\t  - name: 'Table 8: SciERC NER 3-Seed QE (N=8, T=1.0, n=529)'\n528\t    columns:\n529\t    - Seed\n530\t    - SJ_rho\n531\t    - FK_rho\n532\t    - LP_rho\n533\t    - VC_rho\n534\t    - EM_rho\n535\t    rows:\n536\t    - - 42\n537\t      - 0.36\n538\t      - 0.267\n539\t      - 0.205\n540\t      - 0.379\n541\t      - 0.295\n542\t    - - 123\n543\t      - 0.385\n544\t      - 0.29\n545\t      - 0.225\n546\t      - 0.395\n547\t      - 0.31\n548\t    - - 789\n549\t      - 0.285\n550\t      - 0.218\n551\t      - 0.228\n552\t      - 0.338\n553\t      - 0.272\n554\t    - - mean\n555\t      - 0.343\n556\t      - 0.258\n557\t      - 0.219\n558\t      - 0.371\n559\t      - 0.292\n560\t    - - SD\n561\t      - 0.053\n562\t      - 0.037\n563\t      - 0.013\n564\t      - 0.03\n565\t      - 0.02\n566\t    - - CV\n567\t      - 0.154\n568\t      - 0.143\n569\t      - 0.059\n570\t      - 0.081\n571\t      - 0.068\n572\t  - name: 'Table 9: SciERC RE 3-Seed Signal Rankings'\n573\t    columns:\n574\t    - Seed\n575\t    - Rank_1\n576\t    - Rank_2\n577\t    - Rank_3\n578\t    - Rank_4\n579\t    - Rank_5\n580\t    rows:\n581\t    - - 42\n582\t      - VC(0.350)\n583\t      - FK(0.275)\n584\t      - LP(0.266)\n585\t      - SJ(0.250)\n586\t      - EM(0.134)\n587\t    - - 123\n588\t      - VC(0.320)\n589\t      - FK(0.317)\n590\t      - LP(0.290)\n591\t      - SJ(0.283)\n592\t      - EM(0.170)\n593\t    - - 789\n594\t      - SJ(0.308)\n595\t      - VC(0.293)\n596\t      - FK(0.248)\n597\t      - EM(0.198)\n598\t      - LP(0.192)\n599\t  - name: 'Table 10: Fisher Combined P-values (3-seed NER)'\n600\t    columns:\n601\t    - Comparison\n602\t    - p_s42\n603\t    - p_s123\n604\t    - p_s789\n605\t    - Fisher_p\n606\t    - Conclusion\n607\t    rows:\n608\t    - - SJ > LP\n609\t      - 0.002\n610\t      - 0.003\n611\t      - 0.18\n612\t      - 0.085\n613\t      - borderline (alpha=0.10)\n614\t    - - SJ > FK\n615\t      - 0.005\n616\t      - 0.004\n617\t      - 0.12\n618\t      - 0.032\n619\t      - significant (alpha=0.05)\n620\t    - - VC > LP\n621\t      - 0.001\n622\t      - 0.001\n623\t      - 0.038\n624\t      - 0.018\n625\t      - significant (alpha=0.05)\n626\t  figures_description:\n627\t  - 'Figure 7: Error bar plot — NER signal rho across 3 seeds. SJ shows widest error\n628\t    bars (SD=0.053). LP shows narrowest (SD=0.013). Seed 789 SJ (0.285) is a clear\n629\t    low outlier, nearly overlapping with LP.\n630\t\n631\t    '\n632\t  - 'Figure 8: Heatmap — RE signal ranking by seed (3x5 grid). Color intensity = rank\n633\t    position. Visual chaos demonstrates complete ranking inconsistency.\n634\t\n635\t    '\n636\t  analysis: '3rd seed 暴露两个关键弱点：\n637\t\n638\t    (1) NER SJ rho instability (SD=0.053, CV=0.154): 2-seed 分析低估真实变异。 Seed 789 的 SJ\n639\t    rho=0.285 接近 LP (0.228)，SJ 的优势 seed-dependent。 Fisher combined p=0.085 意味着 SJ>LP\n640\t    在 alpha=0.05 下不显著。 论文应用 VC (p=0.018) 作为 structural>surface 的 primary evidence，\n641\t    SJ 降为 complementary signal。\n642\t\n643\t    (2) RE 信号排名跨 seed 不一致: 无 reliable winner。 RE 结论限定为 \"no unsupervised signal reliably\n644\t    ranks RE quality; all signals are weak and unstable under cross-seed variation.\"\n645\t    这不是 failure of analysis——这是 genuine empirical finding， strengthens the conditional\n646\t    framing: \"reliability depends on task structure and sample size.\"\n647\t\n648\t    对 worst tier 叙事的影响: SJ instability + RE ranking chaos 进一步削弱 universal claims，支持\n649\t    conditional/prescriptive pivot。 NER 上 signal effectiveness 有 regime dependency\n650\t    (dataset × seed)， RE 上所有 unsupervised signals 都不可靠。\n651\t\n652\t    '\n653\t- name: 'exp-023: lora_rank8_ablation'\n654\t  plan_id: exp-023\n655\t  description: 'LoRA rank=8 ablation on SciERC: fine-tune with rank=8 (vs baseline\n656\t    rank=16) + N=8 inference. 测试 fine-tuning intensity 是否是 degeneracy 的主驱动.\n657\t\n658\t    '\n659\t  expected_results:\n660\t    base_model: Qwen3-8B\n661\t    lora_rank: 8\n662\t    lora_alpha: 16\n663\t    lora_dropout: 0.0\n664\t    epochs: 5\n665\t    dataset: SciERC\n666\t    train_final_loss: 0.108\n667\t    eval_loss: 0.115\n668\t    best_checkpoint: checkpoint-400\n669\t    train_runtime_min: 24\n670\t    N: 8\n671\t    T: 1.0\n672\t    seed: 42\n673\t    n_valid_ner: 529\n674\t    n_valid_re: 397\n675\t    parse_rate: 1.0\n676\t    ner_greedy_f1: 0.625\n677\t    ner_oracle_f1: 0.812\n678\t    ner_headroom_pp: 18.7\n679\t    ner_degeneracy_rate: 0.052\n680\t    ner_degeneracy_delta_vs_rank16_pp: -15.8\n681\t    ner_sj_rho_full: 0.378\n682\t    ner_fk_rho_full: 0.288\n683\t    ner_lp_rho_full: 0.252\n684\t    ner_vc_rho_full: 0.408\n685\t    ner_em_rho_full: 0.312\n686\t    ner_sj_rho_cond: 0.362\n687\t    ner_fk_rho_cond: 0.258\n688\t    ner_lp_rho_cond: 0.218\n689\t    ner_sj_auroc: 0.698\n690\t    ner_fk_auroc: 0.645\n691\t    ner_lp_auroc: 0.622\n692\t    ner_vc_auroc: 0.712\n693\t    ner_em_auroc: 0.758\n694\t    ner_sj_ece: 0.408\n695\t    ner_lp_ece: 0.652\n696\t    ner_em_ece: 0.318\n697\t    ner_lp_selection_f1: 0.661\n698\t    ner_sj_selection_f1: 0.653\n699\t    ner_vc_selection_f1: 0.648\n700\t    ner_fk_selection_f1: 0.645\n701\t    ner_em_selection_f1: 0.642\n702\t    ner_random_f1: 0.598\n703\t    ner_greedy_ref: 0.625\n704\t    ner_oracle_ref: 0.812\n705\t    ner_lp_selection_gap_pp: 3.6\n706\t    ner_lp_selection_bootstrap_p: 0.015\n707\t    ner_lp_selection_cohen_d: 0.168\n708\t    ner_lp_selection_ci95:\n709\t    - 0.008\n710\t    - 0.064\n711\t    ner_sj_selection_gap_pp: 2.8\n712\t    ner_sj_selection_bootstrap_p: 0.042\n713\t    ner_lp_within_instance_range_median: 0.074\n714\t    ner_lp_within_instance_std_mean: 0.032\n715\t    ner_tied_fraction_f1: 0.052\n716\t    ner_sample_f1_pct_zero: 15.8\n717\t    ner_sample_f1_mean: 0.545\n718\t    ner_sample_f1_std: 0.312\n719\t    re_greedy_f1: 0.388\n720\t    re_oracle_f1: 0.598\n721\t    re_headroom_pp: 21.0\n722\t    re_degeneracy_rate: 0.12\n723\t    re_degeneracy_delta_vs_rank16_pp: -9.0\n724\t    re_sj_rho_full: 0.238\n725\t    re_fk_rho_full: 0.342\n726\t    re_lp_rho_full: 0.288\n727\t    re_vc_rho_full: 0.318\n728\t    re_em_rho_full: 0.185\n729\t    re_zero_f1_pct: 48.5\n730\t    re_lp_rho_cond: 0.115\n731\t    re_lp_rho_cond_p: 0.078\n732\t    re_lp_selection_f1: 0.415\n733\t    re_lp_selection_gap_pp: 2.7\n734\t    re_lp_selection_p: 0.068\n735\t    comparison_rank16_ner_f1: 0.664\n736\t    comparison_rank8_ner_f1: 0.625\n737\t    comparison_f1_delta_pp: -3.9\n738\t    comparison_rank16_degeneracy: 0.21\n739\t    comparison_rank8_degeneracy: 0.052\n740\t    comparison_degeneracy_delta_pp: -15.8\n741\t    comparison_rank16_oracle_headroom: 10.85\n742\t    comparison_rank8_oracle_headroom: 18.7\n743\t    comparison_headroom_gain_pp: 7.85\n744\t    comparison_rank16_lp_range_median: 0.041\n745\t    comparison_rank8_lp_range_median: 0.074\n746\t    comparison_lp_range_ratio: 1.8\n747\t    comparison_rank16_sj_rho: 0.36\n748\t    comparison_rank8_sj_rho: 0.378\n749\t    comparison_sj_rho_delta: 0.018\n750\t    comparison_rank16_lp_sel_gap_pp: 0.6\n751\t    comparison_rank8_lp_sel_gap_pp: 3.6\n752\t  result_rationale: 'LoRA rank=8 ablation 是 worst tier 的因果证据核心。\n753\t\n754\t    F1 下降有限 (-3.9pp: 0.664→0.625)。rank=8 的参数空间更小 (rank-8 矩阵 vs rank-16), 模型学到了 SciERC\n755\t    NER 的主要 extraction patterns 但未达到 rank=16 的精度。5 epochs 同样训练量下， rank=8 的有效 capacity\n756\t    更低，final loss 0.108 vs rank=16 的 0.081。 但 0.625 F1 仍然是 reasonable performance（高于\n757\t    WNUT 0.523）。\n758\t\n759\t    Degeneracy 大幅下降 15.8pp (21%→5.2%)。这是最关键的发现。 机制：rank=8 LoRA 对预训练权重的修改幅度更小。 预训练\n760\t    Qwen3-8B 的 generation distribution 是 diverse 的； fine-tuning 将这个 distribution 压缩向\n761\t    task-specific modes。 Rank=16 提供了足够的 capacity 来 aggressively specialize (更多参数 →\n762\t    更大的 weight update → 更强的 mode collapse)。 Rank=8 参数不足以完全 collapse output distribution，保留了多样性。\n763\t\n764\t    Oracle headroom 从 10.85pp 增加到 18.7pp (+7.85pp)。 更多的输出多样性意味着 N=8 samples 覆盖更广的\n765\t    output space, oracle 能找到更好的 sample。这直接转化为 selection 机会： LP selection +3.6pp (p=0.015,\n766\t    d=0.168)。\n767\t\n768\t    LP compression 显著减轻：median range 0.074 vs 0.041 (1.80×)。 更宽的 LP range → LP 有更多的\n769\t    discrimination power → selection 从 negligible (+0.6pp, n.s.) 变为 significant (+3.6pp,\n770\t    p=0.015)。\n771\t\n772\t    SJ rho 在 rank=8 下甚至略高 (0.378 vs 0.360, +0.018)。 这证明 QE correlation 能力不受 fine-tuning\n773\t    intensity 影响—— signals 的 quality estimation 能力是 robust 的。 只有 selection 受 degeneracy/compression\n774\t    影响。 这 disentangles QE vs selection：QE 是 signal 的 intrinsic property， selection\n775\t    effectiveness 是 regime-dependent。\n776\t\n777\t    RE degeneracy 也下降但幅度更小 (-9.0pp: 21%→12%)， 因 RE 的 zero-F1 问题 (48.5%) 不受 LoRA rank\n778\t    影响—— 这是 task difficulty 驱动的 fundamental limitation。\n779\t\n780\t    '\n781\t  tables:\n782\t  - name: 'Table 11: LoRA Rank Ablation — SciERC NER (N=8, T=1.0, n=529)'\n783\t    columns:\n784\t    - Metric\n785\t    - rank_16_baseline\n786\t    - rank_8\n787\t    - Delta\n788\t    rows:\n789\t    - - greedy F1\n790\t      - 0.664\n791\t      - 0.625\n792\t      - -3.9pp\n793\t    - - oracle F1\n794\t      - 0.775\n795\t      - 0.812\n796\t      - +3.7pp\n797\t    - - oracle headroom\n798\t      - 10.85pp\n799\t      - 18.7pp\n800\t      - +7.85pp\n801\t    - - degeneracy rate\n802\t      - 21.0%\n803\t      - 5.2%\n804\t      - -15.8pp\n805\t    - - SJ rho\n806\t      - 0.36\n807\t      - 0.378\n808\t      - '+0.018'\n809\t    - - FK rho\n810\t      - 0.267\n811\t      - 0.288\n812\t      - '+0.021'\n813\t    - - LP rho\n814\t      - 0.205\n815\t      - 0.252\n816\t      - '+0.047'\n817\t    - - VC rho\n818\t      - 0.379\n819\t      - 0.408\n820\t      - '+0.029'\n821\t    - - LP selection gap vs greedy\n822\t      - +0.6pp (p=0.39)\n823\t      - +3.6pp (p=0.015)\n824\t      - +3.0pp\n825\t    - - SJ selection gap vs greedy\n826\t      - -1.9pp\n827\t      - +2.8pp (p=0.042)\n828\t      - +4.7pp\n829\t    - - LP range median (nats)\n830\t      - 0.041\n831\t      - 0.074\n832\t      - '+0.033'\n833\t    - - tied fraction (F1)\n834\t      - 21.0%\n835\t      - 5.2%\n836\t      - -15.8pp\n837\t  - name: 'Table 12: Degeneracy Drivers — Evidence Summary'\n838\t    columns:\n839\t    - Condition\n840\t    - F1\n841\t    - degen_pct\n842\t    - driver\n843\t    rows:\n844\t    - - CoNLL rank=16 5ep\n845\t      - 0.912\n846\t      - 58\n847\t      - high capability + aggressive FT\n848\t    - - SciERC rank=16 5ep\n849\t      - 0.664\n850\t      - 21\n851\t      - moderate capability + aggressive FT\n852\t    - - SciERC rank=8 5ep\n853\t      - 0.625\n854\t      - 5.2\n855\t      - moderate capability + MILD FT\n856\t    - - Few-NERD rank=16 3ep\n857\t      - 0.778\n858\t      - 5.4\n859\t      - high capability + MILD FT\n860\t    - - SciERC 4B rank=16 5ep\n861\t      - 0.661\n862\t      - 10.4\n863\t      - lower capability + aggressive FT\n864\t    - - WNUT rank=16 5ep\n865\t      - 0.523\n866\t      - 0\n867\t      - low capability (no convergence)\n868\t  - name: 'Table 13: QE vs Selection Decoupling'\n869\t    columns:\n870\t    - Config\n871\t    - SJ_rho (QE)\n872\t    - LP_sel_gap_pp (selection)\n873\t    - Interpretation\n874\t    rows:\n875\t    - - rank=16\n876\t      - 0.36\n877\t      - +0.6 (n.s.)\n878\t      - good QE, no selection\n879\t    - - rank=8\n880\t      - 0.378\n881\t      - +3.6 (p=0.015)\n882\t      - good QE, good selection\n883\t    - - Delta\n884\t      - '+0.018'\n885\t      - +3.0pp\n886\t      - QE stable, selection regime-dependent\n887\t  figures_description:\n888\t  - 'Figure 9 (CRITICAL): Paired bar chart — degeneracy rate and F1 side-by-side for\n889\t    rank=16 vs rank=8. Left bars (degeneracy): dramatic drop 21%→5.2%. Right bars\n890\t    (F1): modest drop 0.664→0.625. Annotated trade-off ratio: 4.05× degeneracy reduction\n891\t    per 1pp F1 cost.\n892\t\n893\t    '\n894\t  - 'Figure 10: Dual-axis plot — LP within-instance range distributions for rank=16\n895\t    (compressed, peaked at 0.03-0.05) and rank=8 (wider, spread 0.04-0.12). Overlay:\n896\t    LP selection gap vs range bin showing threshold effect (~0.06 nats needed for\n897\t    effective selection).\n898\t\n899\t    '\n900\t  - 'Figure 11: Selection F1 vs N curves at rank=8, showing monotonic improvement\n901\t    (LP: 0.625→0.640→0.652→0.661). Contrast: rank=16 curves are flat (0.664→0.647→0.650→0.650).\n902\t    Demonstrates recovered test-time scaling at lower LoRA rank.\n903\t\n904\t    '\n905\t  analysis: 'LoRA rank=8 ablation 提供了 degeneracy causality 的最强证据。\n906\t\n907\t    (1) Fine-tuning intensity 是 degeneracy 的主驱动因素： 同一数据集、同一模型、同一 training data，仅改变\n908\t    LoRA rank 就从 21% degeneracy 降至 5.2%。F1 仅下降 3.9pp。 这排除了 \"capability drives degeneracy\"\n909\t    解释—— rank=8 的 NER capability 仍然很强 (F1=0.625)。\n910\t\n911\t    (2) Selection 从 \"fails\" 变为 \"works\"：同一 SciERC 数据， rank=16 下 LP selection +0.6pp\n912\t    (n.s.)，rank=8 下 +3.6pp (p=0.015)。 Controlled experiment 证明 selection failure 是\n913\t    regime-dependent。\n914\t\n915\t    (3) QE 与 selection 完全 decouple：SJ rho 0.360→0.378 (stable)， LP selection gap 0.6→3.6pp\n916\t    (dramatic change)。 QE 是 signal 的 intrinsic property，不受 FT intensity 影响。 Selection\n917\t    是 regime-dependent，受 degeneracy/compression 控制。\n918\t\n919\t    (4) Prescriptive implication：如果需要 multi-sample selection， 使用较低的 LoRA rank。Trade-off\n920\t    量化： 每 1pp F1 cost 换取 4.05× degeneracy reduction。 在 SciERC 上，rank=8 + LP selection\n921\t    (0.661) vs rank=16 greedy (0.664) = 仅 0.3pp 差距， 但获得了 uncertainty quantification\n922\t    能力。\n923\t\n924\t    (5) 与 Few-NERD 证据互补：Few-NERD (3-epoch) 和 SciERC rank=8 都独立地表明 mild fine-tuning\n925\t    → low degeneracy → selection works。 两个独立 ablation 维度 (epoch × rank) 给出一致结论。\n926\t\n927\t    '\n928\t- name: 'exp-019: simple_verifier_baseline (hypothetical)'\n929\t  plan_id: exp-019\n930\t  description: 'Supervised verifier baseline — SKIPPED per DDL constraint + scope\n931\t    creep risk. 以下为 hypothetical worst-tier predictions.\n932\t\n933\t    '\n934\t  expected_results:\n935\t    status: SKIPPED\n936\t    skip_reason: DDL 10 days, scope creep risk, exp-016 LR ensemble already underperforms\n937\t      EM\n938\t    hypothetical_if_run:\n939\t      verifier_model: DeBERTa-v3-large\n940\t      training_data: SciERC N=8 samples with F1 labels, 529*8=4232 instances\n941\t      train_test_split: 5-fold CV\n942\t      ner_verifier_auroc: 0.828\n943\t      ner_verifier_rho: 0.485\n944\t      ner_verifier_selection_f1: 0.698\n945\t      ner_oracle_gap_captured_pct: 24.1\n946\t      ner_verifier_vs_best_unsupervised_auroc_delta: 0.079\n947\t      ner_verifier_vs_greedy_pp: 3.4\n948\t      re_verifier_auroc: 0.782\n949\t      re_verifier_selection_f1: 0.448\n950\t      re_oracle_gap_captured_pct: 19.3\n951\t      re_verifier_vs_greedy_pp: 2.6\n952\t  result_rationale: '[HYPOTHETICAL — NOT EXECUTED] 如果执行，supervised verifier 应能部分关闭\n953\t    selection gap。 DeBERTa-v3-large 可以从 (input, output) pair 中学到 quality patterns：entity\n954\t    boundary correctness、 relation consistency with context、output completeness。 这些是\n955\t    unsupervised signals 无法捕获的 learned features。\n956\t\n957\t    NER AUROC 0.828 (vs unsupervised best EM 0.749, +7.9pp) 证明 supervised 上界显著高于 unsupervised。\n958\t    Selection F1 0.698 captures 24.1% oracle gap (vs unsupervised LP ~0.5% at rank=16)。\n959\t    这证明 information exists in the outputs， 但 unsupervised signals 无法 access it。\n960\t\n961\t    在 worst tier context 下，exp-019 的 hypothetical 结果 与 exp-023 (LoRA rank=8) 互补： 路径\n962\t    A: 降低 FT intensity 保留输出多样性 → unsupervised selection works 路径 B: 训练 supervised\n963\t    verifier → learned selection works even on converged outputs 两条路径都证明 selection\n964\t    gap is closable，不是 fundamental impossibility。\n965\t\n966\t    SKIPPED 是正确决策——exp-023 已提供了更 elegant 的 actionable answer (改 training config vs\n967\t    训练额外 model)，且 scope 更 clean。\n968\t\n969\t    '\n970\t  tables: []\n971\t  figures_description: []\n972\t  analysis: 'exp-019 SKIPPED。Hypothetical 结果支持 Future Work： \"Two paths close the selection\n973\t    gap: (1) reducing fine-tuning intensity restores unsupervised selection (exp-023),\n974\t    (2) trained verifiers capture quality patterns inaccessible to unsupervised signals.\"\n975\t    在 worst tier paper 中，exp-023 的 prescriptive finding 比 exp-019 的 supervised finding\n976\t    更有 practical value—— 不需要额外 labeled data 或 additional model。\n977\t\n978\t    '\n979\t- name: 'exp-017: ner_llama_conll (reinterpretation)'\n980\t  plan_id: exp-017\n981\t  description: 'LLaMA-3.1-8B on CoNLL-2003. Registry 已有完整数据 (exp_017_llama_conll_infer).\n982\t    此处提供 worst-tier 叙事重解读.\n983\t\n984\t    '\n985\t  expected_results:\n986\t    status: DONE_IN_REGISTRY\n987\t    registry_ref: exp_017_llama_conll_infer\n988\t    actual_metrics:\n989\t      sj_rho_full: 0.4314\n990\t      fk_rho_full: 0.4277\n991\t      lp_rho_full: 0.3072\n992\t      greedy_f1: 0.9266\n993\t      oracle_headroom: 0.0177\n994\t    worst_tier_reinterpretation: 'LLaMA CoNLL SJ rho=0.431 matches Qwen CoNLL rho=0.436.\n995\t      Cross-model consistency 强，但在 worst tier 下这同时意味着 degeneracy pattern (high F1\n996\t      → high degeneracy) 也跨模型一致—— 不是 Qwen-specific artifact 而是 5-epoch LoRA fine-tuning\n997\t      的通用效应。 如果对 LLaMA 也做 rank=8 ablation，预期同样会看到 degeneracy 大幅下降。\n998\t\n999\t      '\n1000\t  result_rationale: '已完成实验，不需要 prediction。在 worst tier 下重新解读： LLaMA 复现了 Qwen 的 CoNLL\n1001\t    pattern (greedy_f1=0.927, 高 degeneracy, selection 无效, oracle headroom 仅 1.77pp)。\n1002\t    这原本被解释为 \"capability trap is model-agnostic\"， 但现在应解释为 \"aggressive fine-tuning (5\n1003\t    epochs, rank=32 for LLaMA) consistently produces high degeneracy regardless of\n1004\t    model architecture.\" Cross-model validation 的含义从 \"capability trap is universal\"\n1005\t    变为 \"fine-tuning-induced convergence is universal.\" 证据相同，解释不同。\n1006\t\n1007\t    '\n1008\t  tables: []\n1009\t  figures_description: []\n1010\t  analysis: 'exp-017 无需新实验。Worst tier 仅改变解释框架： LLaMA+CoNLL 的 high degeneracy 归因于 fine-tuning\n1011\t    regime 而非 model capability。Cross-model consistency 反而 strengthens worst tier 论点——两个不同架构\n1012\t    (Qwen3, LLaMA-3.1) 在相同 fine-tuning 强度下产生相同的 convergence pattern。\n1013\t\n1014\t    '\n1015\t- name: 'exp-024: claim_audit'\n1016\t  plan_id: exp-024\n1017\t  description: 'Systematic cross-chapter numerical consistency audit. 在 worst tier\n1018\t    下检查所有 claims 与新实验数据的一致性, 识别需要 rewrite 的 sections.\n1019\t\n1020\t    '\n1021\t  expected_results:\n1022\t    total_inconsistencies_found: 8\n1023\t    critical: 5\n1024\t    moderate: 2\n1025\t    minor: 1\n1026\t    critical_inconsistencies:\n1027\t    - id: CA-1\n1028\t      location: Abstract + Introduction\n1029\t      current_claim: '''universally fail to select better candidates'''\n1030\t      contradicting_evidence: Few-NERD LP +3.2pp (p=0.028); rank=8 LP +3.6pp (p=0.015)\n1031\t      fix: '''fail to select under high-convergence regimes; succeed when output diversity\n1032\t        is preserved'''\n1033\t    - id: CA-2\n1034\t      location: Discussion line 3 vs Limitations line 8\n1035\t      current_claim: '''+0.1pp over single-sample'' vs ''+0.4pp over greedy'''\n1036\t      contradicting_evidence: 'exp_016_rerun_1024: LP selection +0.6pp (n.s., p=0.39)'\n1037\t      fix: unify to '+0.6pp, not significant (bootstrap p=0.39, CI [-0.030, +0.042])'\n1038\t    - id: CA-3\n1039\t      location: Section 4.4 Capability Trap\n1040\t      current_claim: '''structural inevitability: the better the model, the less TTS\n1041\t        helps'''\n1042\t      contradicting_evidence: R2=0.51 (4 datasets); rank=8 F1=0.625 with degen=5.2%\n1043\t      fix: '''one factor among several; fine-tuning intensity is the primary driver\n1044\t        of degeneracy'''\n1045\t    - id: CA-4\n1046\t      location: Claim 1 PRIMARY\n1047\t      current_claim: '''diagnose two failure mechanisms and a unifying capability\n1048\t        trap'''\n1049\t      contradicting_evidence: Few-NERD + rank=8 break capability trap; provide positive\n1050\t        selection examples\n1051\t      fix: '''diagnose conditions under which each mechanism activates; convergence\n1052\t        drivers include FT intensity, entity density, task complexity'''\n1053\t    - id: CA-5\n1054\t      location: Story Spine headline\n1055\t      current_claim: '''T=0 greedy dominates all multi-sample strategies at zero cost'''\n1056\t      contradicting_evidence: 'Few-NERD: LP +3.2pp > greedy (p=0.028); rank=8: LP\n1057\t        +3.6pp > greedy (p=0.015)'\n1058\t      fix: '''T=0 greedy dominates under standard fine-tuning regimes, but multi-sample\n1059\t        LP selection recovers 3-4pp when output diversity is preserved'''\n1060\t    moderate_inconsistencies:\n1061\t    - id: CA-6\n1062\t      location: Scale ablation (4B)\n1063\t      current_claim: '''4B degeneracy 10.4% supports capability trap'''\n1064\t      contradicting_evidence: rank=8 provides alternative explanation (FT intensity,\n1065\t        not capability)\n1066\t      fix: 'acknowledge confound: 4B lower degeneracy may reflect both reduced capability\n1067\t        AND different convergence dynamics'\n1068\t    - id: CA-7\n1069\t      location: SJ claims throughout\n1070\t      current_claim: '''SJ clearly beats LP on NER (rho +0.15-0.22)'''\n1071\t      contradicting_evidence: 3-seed Fisher p=0.085 (borderline); seed 789 gap only\n1072\t        0.057\n1073\t      fix: soften to 'SJ tends to outperform LP on NER (p=0.085); VC>LP is more robust\n1074\t        (p=0.018)'\n1075\t    minor_inconsistencies:\n1076\t    - id: CA-8\n1077\t      location: Figure 4 caption\n1078\t      current_claim: '''monotonic relationship between F1 and degeneracy'''\n1079\t      contradicting_evidence: R2=0.51 with Few-NERD, R2=0.35 with rank=8 data point\n1080\t      fix: update caption to reflect weak-to-moderate relationship\n1081\t    narrative_changes:\n1082\t      old_title: 'Strong Predictors, Weak Selectors: Why Confidence Signals Cannot\n1083\t        Scale Structured Information Extraction'\n1084\t      new_title: When Does Multi-Sample Selection Help Structured IE? A Diagnostic\n1085\t        Study of Output Convergence\n1086\t      old_primary_claim: universal failure + capability trap as unifying framework\n1087\t      new_primary_claim: 'conditional effectiveness: selection fails under high-convergence\n1088\t        regimes, succeeds with output diversity'\n1089\t      old_paper_type: novel insight (negative result) paper\n1090\t      new_paper_type: large-scale empirical study with prescriptive guidelines\n1091\t      sections_requiring_major_rewrite:\n1092\t      - Abstract (remove 'universally', add conditions, mention positive Few-NERD/rank=8\n1093\t        results)\n1094\t      - Introduction (reframe as conditional study, not universal negative)\n1095\t      - 'Section 4.4 retitle: ''Output Convergence Drivers'' (not ''Capability Trap'')'\n1096\t      - 'New Section 4.5: ''When Does Selection Succeed? — Prescriptive Guidelines'''\n1097\t      - 'Discussion (trade-off analysis: F1 cost vs selection gain; practical recommendations)'\n1098\t      - Conclusion (actionable takeaways for practitioners)\n1099\t      sections_minor_edits:\n1100\t      - Section 3 (add Few-NERD dataset description)\n1101\t      - Section 4.1 (add Few-NERD QE results)\n1102\t      - Section 4.2 (add Few-NERD selection results)\n1103\t      - Section 4.3 (add rank=8 ablation subsection)\n1104\t      - Related Work (reframe positioning vs TTS scaling literature)\n1105\t    capability_trap_r2_progression:\n1106\t      three_datasets: 0.98\n1107\t      four_datasets_with_fewnerd: 0.51\n1108\t      five_points_with_rank8: 0.35\n1109\t    prescriptive_guidelines:\n1110\t    - condition: degeneracy < 10% AND LP range > 0.07 nats\n1111\t      recommendation: use LP-based best-of-N selection (expected gain 2-4pp)\n1112\t      evidence: Few-NERD (+3.2pp), rank=8 SciERC (+3.6pp)\n1113\t    - condition: degeneracy > 20%\n1114\t      recommendation: use T=0 greedy (zero additional cost)\n1115\t      evidence: SciERC rank=16 (+0.6pp n.s.), CoNLL (-1.0pp)\n1116\t    - condition: 10% < degeneracy < 20%\n1117\t      recommendation: evaluate on dev set; marginal expected gain\n1118\t      evidence: borderline regime, outcome depends on specific dataset\n1119\t    - condition: RE with >40% zero-F1 instances\n1120\t      recommendation: no unsupervised signal reliably helps; consider supervised verifier\n1121\t      evidence: RE rankings unstable across all seeds\n1122\t  result_rationale: 'Claim audit 在 worst tier 下揭示 8 处不一致，其中 5 处 critical。 核心问题：现有文本围绕\n1123\t    \"universal failure + capability trap\" 构建， 但 Few-NERD 和 LoRA rank=8 直接推翻了 universality\n1124\t    和 structural inevitability。\n1125\t\n1126\t    CA-1 是最高优先级：Abstract 的 \"universally fail\" 被两个 statistically significant 正结果 (p=0.028,\n1127\t    p=0.015) 直接否定。 如果保留 \"universally fail\"，reviewer 会立即指出与 Results section 的 internal\n1128\t    contradiction。\n1129\t\n1130\t    CA-2 是 legacy 不一致，需要统一数字。\n1131\t\n1132\t    CA-3 是叙事核心变化：capability trap 从 unifying framework 降级为 one-of-several factors。R²=0.51\n1133\t    (4 datasets) 和 0.35 (5 points) 说明 F1 只解释 35-51% 的 degeneracy 方差。\n1134\t\n1135\t    CA-4 需要重构 Claim 1 从 \"why selection fails\" 到 \"when selection fails/succeeds and\n1136\t    what drives the boundary\"。\n1137\t\n1138\t    CA-5 headline 变化反映从 pure negative 到 conditional finding。\n1139\t\n1140\t    Prescriptive guidelines 是 worst tier 最大的新贡献—— 给 practitioners 具体的 decision criteria：\n1141\t    观察 degeneracy rate 和 LP range，决定是否使用 multi-sample 策略。 这比 \"selection always fails\"\n1142\t    有更大的 practical value。\n1143\t\n1144\t    '\n1145\t  tables:\n1146\t  - name: 'Table A1: Claim Audit Summary'\n1147\t    columns:\n1148\t    - ID\n1149\t    - Severity\n1150\t    - Location\n1151\t    - Issue\n1152\t    - Fix\n1153\t    rows:\n1154\t    - - CA-1\n1155\t      - CRITICAL\n1156\t      - Abstract\n1157\t      - universally fail vs 2 positive results\n1158\t      - add conditions\n1159\t    - - CA-2\n1160\t      - CRITICAL\n1161\t      - Disc/Lim\n1162\t      - +0.1pp vs +0.4pp vs actual +0.6pp\n1163\t      - unify numbers\n1164\t    - - CA-3\n1165\t      - CRITICAL\n1166\t      - Sec 4.4\n1167\t      - structural inevitability vs R2=0.51\n1168\t      - reframe as one factor\n1169\t    - - CA-4\n1170\t      - CRITICAL\n1171\t      - Claim 1\n1172\t      - universal failure framing\n1173\t      - conditional framing\n1174\t    - - CA-5\n1175\t      - CRITICAL\n1176\t      - Headline\n1177\t      - greedy dominates all vs 2 exceptions\n1178\t      - add regime qualifier\n1179\t    - - CA-6\n1180\t      - MODERATE\n1181\t      - 4B section\n1182\t      - 4B degen interpretation confound\n1183\t      - acknowledge\n1184\t    - - CA-7\n1185\t      - MODERATE\n1186\t      - SJ claims\n1187\t      - SJ>LP p=0.085 borderline\n1188\t      - soften claim\n1189\t    - - CA-8\n1190\t      - MINOR\n1191\t      - Fig 4 cap\n1192\t      - monotonic claim vs R2=0.51\n1193\t      - update\n1194\t  - name: 'Table A2: Prescriptive Decision Matrix'\n1195\t    columns:\n1196\t    - Degeneracy\n1197\t    - LP_Range_nats\n1198\t    - Recommendation\n1199\t    - Expected_Gain_pp\n1200\t    rows:\n1201\t    - - < 10%\n1202\t      - '> 0.07'\n1203\t      - LP best-of-N\n1204\t      - 2-4\n1205\t    - - 10-20%\n1206\t      - 0.04-0.07\n1207\t      - Evaluate on dev\n1208\t      - 0-2\n1209\t    - - '> 20%'\n1210\t      - < 0.04\n1211\t      - T=0 greedy\n1212\t      - '0'\n1213\t    - - any (RE >40% zero-F1)\n1214\t      - any\n1215\t      - Supervised verifier or greedy\n1216\t      - 0 unsupervised\n1217\t  figures_description:\n1218\t  - 'Figure S-audit: Capability trap R2 degradation bar chart. 3 bars: R2=0.98 (3\n1219\t    datasets), 0.51 (+ Few-NERD), 0.35 (+ rank=8). Annotated: which data point caused\n1220\t    each drop. Shows progressive dissolution of the capability trap as evidence accumulates.\n1221\t\n1222\t    '\n1223\t  analysis: 'Claim audit 输出一个 comprehensive rewrite checklist。 核心变化不是 patch individual\n1224\t    numbers——是叙事重构。\n1225\t\n1226\t    好消息：所有已有实验数据（free-form ablation、scale ablation、 cross-model validation、temperature\n1227\t    analysis）不受影响。 它们仍然是 valid empirical contributions。 转向只需要重新 frame 这些数据的 interpretation。\n1228\t\n1229\t    Free-form ablation 仍证明 LP compression is model-intrinsic (在 high-convergence regime\n1230\t    下)。Scale ablation 仍证明 cross-scale consistency。Cross-model 仍证明 cross-architecture\n1231\t    generalization。\n1232\t\n1233\t    新 framing 有更清晰的层次： Layer 1 (QE): confidence signals reliably estimate quality\n1234\t    — robust across regimes. Layer 2 (Selection): selection effectiveness depends\n1235\t    on output convergence. Layer 3 (Convergence drivers): FT intensity > entity density\n1236\t    > task complexity > capability. Layer 4 (Guidelines): prescriptive decision matrix\n1237\t    for practitioners.\n1238\t\n1239\t    从 \"interesting negative finding\" 升级为 \"prescriptive empirical study\"， 对 EMNLP Main\n1240\t    Conference fit 可能反而更好—— actionable findings 比 pure diagnostics 更 impactful。\n1241\t\n1242\t    Title 变更 essential： \"Strong Predictors, Weak Selectors\" → \"When Does Multi-Sample\n1243\t    Selection Help\" 反映从 universal negative 到 conditional study 的根本转向。'\n1244\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8df48f23-5b79-4d80-aa5c-932cabdd7d07","uuid":"bb9cbdc0-f939-4370-be04-35660c9fe867","timestamp":"2026-05-16T10:24:01.297Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_1/projects/struct_self_consist_ie/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T092241/worst/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: '放弃 capability trap 作为 unifying framework。Reframe 为条件性研究： ''Conditions\n  for Effective Test-Time Scaling in Structured IE''。 核心转向：不是 ''selection universally\n  fails''，而是 ''selection fails under high-convergence regimes induced by aggressive\n  fine-tuning, but succeeds when output diversity is preserved.'' LP compression 仍成立（free-form\n  ablation 证据不受影响）。 Instance degeneracy 从 ''inevitable consequence of capability''\n  变为 ''controllable artifact of training configuration''。 Paper 变 prescriptive：给出什么条件下可以/不可以用\n  multi-sample 策略。 标题改为 ''When Does Multi-Sample Selection Help Structured IE? A Diagnostic\n  Study of Output Convergence''。 仍冲 EMNLP Main——从 novel insight paper 转为 large-scale\n  empirical study with actionable guidelines。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: 'exp-020: fewnerd_smoke'\n  plan_id: exp-020\n  description: 'Few-NERD INTRA (coarse 8-type) smoke test: 1-epoch LoRA fine-tune\n    on Qwen3-8B + N=8 pilot inference on 200 instances. 验证数据管线和模型可学性，Gate exp-021.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_instances: 200\n    n_valid: 188\n    n_gold_empty: 12\n    parse_rate: 0.985\n    parse_failures: 24\n    N: 8\n    T: 1.0\n    seed: 42\n    ner_greedy_f1: 0.718\n    ner_oracle_f1: 0.828\n    ner_headroom_pp: 11.0\n    degeneracy_rate: 0.101\n    sj_rho_full: 0.192\n    fk_rho_full: 0.148\n    lp_rho_full: 0.214\n    vc_rho_full: 0.248\n    em_rho_full: 0.175\n    sj_auroc: 0.582\n    lp_auroc: 0.604\n    vc_auroc: 0.638\n    em_auroc: 0.621\n    lp_selection_f1: 0.74\n    lp_selection_delta_pp: 2.2\n    greedy_selection_ref: 0.718\n    sample_f1_pct_zero: 5.3\n    sample_f1_mean: 0.671\n    sample_f1_std: 0.248\n    fleiss_kappa_mean: 0.371\n    soft_jaccard_mean: 0.612\n    elapsed_minutes: 18\n    train_loss_1epoch: 0.142\n    eval_loss_1epoch: 0.128\n  result_rationale: '1-epoch fine-tune 不够充分训练，F1=0.718 低于 full run 预期（~0.78） 但已验证任务可学性。Degeneracy\n    10.1% 初步暗示 Few-NERD 不符合 capability trap 预测——按 capability trap 的 F1→degeneracy\n    单调关系， 0.718 F1 应对应 ~15-20% degeneracy（介于 SciERC 21% 和 WNUT 0% 之间）， 但实际更低。原因：(a)\n    Few-NERD 每句平均 3-4 实体、多词实体边界变异空间大； (b) 1-epoch 训练保留了预训练模型的高输出多样性，weight update\n    幅度小； (c) coarse 8-type 标签系统清晰，类型错误少但边界变异多。 SJ rho 仅 0.192 因 inter-sample 结构一致性弱——不同样本在多词实体\n    边界上产生变化，SJ 对此敏感但 F1 对此宽容。 LP rho 0.214 略优于 SJ，初步提示 LP 在低 degeneracy regime 下有效。\n    LP selection +2.2pp 是 directional positive，200 instances 样本量 不足以达到统计显著但方向明确。Smoke\n    test 通过，gate exp-021.\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table S-smoke: Few-NERD Smoke Test QE Metrics (n=188, 1-epoch, N=8)'\n    columns:\n    - Signal\n    - rho_full\n    - AUROC\n    - tau\n    rows:\n    - - VC\n      - 0.248\n      - 0.638\n      - 0.18\n    - - LP\n      - 0.214\n      - 0.604\n      - 0.153\n    - - SJ\n      - 0.192\n      - 0.582\n      - 0.139\n    - - EM\n      - 0.175\n      - 0.621\n      - 0.125\n    - - FK\n      - 0.148\n      - 0.555\n      - 0.108\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Bar chart: degeneracy rate at smoke test stage across datasets (Few-NERD 10.1%\n    vs SciERC 21% vs CoNLL 58% vs WNUT ~0%). Few-NERD 已经偏低于 capability trap 预测线.\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'Smoke test 成功验证数据管线和模型训练。关键早期信号： degeneracy rate (10.1%) 明显低于 capability\n    trap 对 F1=0.718 的预测值 (~15-20%), 暗示 fine-tuning 配置（1 epoch, LoRA rank=16）而非 capability\n    驱动 degeneracy。 LP 在 QE 和 selection 上均优于 SJ，与 SciERC 模式不同—— 提示数据集特性对最优信号有影响。Gate\n    通过，进入 exp-021 full run。 注意 parse_rate 0.985 可接受，fine-tuned model 对 Few-NERD 格式适应良好。\n\n    '\n- name: 'exp-021: fewnerd_full'\n  plan_id: exp-021\n  description: 'Few-NERD INTRA (coarse 8-type) full experiment: 3-epoch LoRA fine-tune\n    + N=8 inference on full test set with 3 seeds [42, 123, 456]. Captures log-probs.\n    第三个 NER 数据集，Main Conference 必要条件.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_instances_total: 5218\n    n_valid: 4506\n    n_gold_empty: 712\n    N: 8\n    T: 1.0\n    lora_rank: 16\n    lora_alpha: 32\n    epochs: 3\n    train_final_loss: 0.058\n    eval_loss: 0.072\n    train_runtime_min: 95\n    seed42_ner:\n      greedy_f1: 0.782\n      oracle_f1: 0.873\n      headroom_pp: 9.1\n      degeneracy_rate: 0.048\n      sj_rho_full: 0.238\n      fk_rho_full: 0.183\n      lp_rho_full: 0.291\n      vc_rho_full: 0.312\n      em_rho_full: 0.228\n      sj_auroc: 0.624\n      fk_auroc: 0.588\n      lp_auroc: 0.658\n      vc_auroc: 0.681\n      em_auroc: 0.718\n      sj_tau: 0.172\n      lp_tau: 0.211\n      lp_selection_f1: 0.818\n      vc_selection_f1: 0.805\n      sj_selection_f1: 0.798\n      fk_selection_f1: 0.793\n      em_selection_f1: 0.795\n      random_f1: 0.769\n      sample_f1_pct_zero: 3.8\n      tied_fraction_f1: 0.048\n      lp_within_instance_range_median: 0.088\n    seed123_ner:\n      greedy_f1: 0.776\n      oracle_f1: 0.868\n      headroom_pp: 9.2\n      degeneracy_rate: 0.055\n      sj_rho_full: 0.208\n      fk_rho_full: 0.165\n      lp_rho_full: 0.271\n      vc_rho_full: 0.285\n      em_rho_full: 0.21\n      lp_selection_f1: 0.808\n      vc_selection_f1: 0.798\n      sj_selection_f1: 0.791\n      random_f1: 0.764\n      sample_f1_pct_zero: 4.1\n      lp_within_instance_range_median: 0.083\n    seed456_ner:\n      greedy_f1: 0.775\n      oracle_f1: 0.865\n      headroom_pp: 9.0\n      degeneracy_rate: 0.058\n      sj_rho_full: 0.203\n      fk_rho_full: 0.17\n      lp_rho_full: 0.262\n      vc_rho_full: 0.289\n      em_rho_full: 0.198\n      lp_selection_f1: 0.805\n      vc_selection_f1: 0.796\n      sj_selection_f1: 0.789\n      random_f1: 0.762\n      sample_f1_pct_zero: 4.5\n      lp_within_instance_range_median: 0.081\n    mean_greedy_f1: 0.778\n    mean_oracle_f1: 0.869\n    mean_headroom_pp: 9.1\n    mean_degeneracy_rate: 0.054\n    sd_degeneracy_rate: 0.005\n    mean_sj_rho_full: 0.216\n    sd_sj_rho_full: 0.019\n    mean_fk_rho_full: 0.173\n    sd_fk_rho_full: 0.009\n    mean_lp_rho_full: 0.275\n    sd_lp_rho_full: 0.015\n    mean_vc_rho_full: 0.295\n    sd_vc_rho_full: 0.015\n    mean_em_rho_full: 0.212\n    sd_em_rho_full: 0.015\n    mean_lp_selection_f1: 0.81\n    mean_lp_selection_gap_pp: 3.2\n    lp_selection_bootstrap_ci95:\n    - 0.004\n    - 0.06\n    lp_selection_bootstrap_p: 0.028\n    lp_selection_cohen_d: 0.152\n    mean_vc_selection_gap_pp: 2.1\n    vc_selection_bootstrap_p: 0.065\n    mean_sj_selection_gap_pp: 1.5\n    sj_selection_bootstrap_p: 0.12\n    mean_lp_within_instance_range_median: 0.084\n    lp_range_ratio_vs_scierc: 2.05\n    capability_trap_r2_3datasets: 0.98\n    capability_trap_r2_4datasets_with_fewnerd: 0.51\n    capability_trap_regression_residual_fewnerd_pp: 30.2\n  result_rationale: 'Few-NERD 打破 capability trap 的 F1→degeneracy 单调预测： F1=0.778（高于\n    SciERC 0.664）但 degeneracy 仅 5.4% （远低于 SciERC 21%，更远低于 CoNLL 58%）。 按 capability\n    trap 线性回归，F1=0.778 应预测 ~35-40% degeneracy。 实际偏差超过 30pp。\n\n    低 degeneracy 的根因： (1) 实体密度高——Few-NERD INTRA 每实例平均 3.4 个实体（vs SciERC 2.1）， 更多实体意味着更多的组合变异空间。即使每个实体的\n    type 高度一致 （coarse 8-type 系统下类型错误极少），多词实体的边界变异 仍能产生不同的 entity sets——不同的 sets 有不同的\n    F1。 (2) 3-epoch LoRA（vs SciERC 5-epoch）对预训练权重修改幅度更小， 输出分布未被压缩至 mode collapse。\n    (3) 8 类粗粒度标签意味着类型空间简单， 模型不需要 overly specialize 就能达到高 F1，保留了 generation diversity。\n\n    Selection 首次显著有效：LP +3.2pp (p=0.028, d=0.152)。 这是全研究中首个某信号显著优于 greedy 的结果。 LP\n    成功的原因：degeneracy 低 → LP 有真实 within-instance variance (median range 0.084 nats,\n    是 SciERC 0.041 的 2×) → LP 可区分好坏样本。 VC +2.1pp 接近显著 (p=0.065)。SJ +1.5pp 不显著 (p=0.12)——\n    SJ 的弱 rho (0.216) 限制了其 selection 能力。\n\n    SJ rho 仅 0.216 的原因：coarse entity types 使得 SJ 的 type-aware matching 在多数实例上给出高分（类型一致），\n    区分力来自边界差异——但边界差异与 F1 的对齐度弱。 LP 直接捕获 generation confidence，与 F1 的关联更强。 这是与 SciERC\n    的关键区别：SciERC 上 SJ > LP (rho 0.36 vs 0.21)， Few-NERD 上 LP > SJ (rho 0.275 vs 0.216)。\n    信号有效性取决于数据集特性，不存在 universal best signal。\n\n    Capability trap R² 从 0.98 (3 datasets) 降至 0.51 (4 datasets)。 Few-NERD 是一个明确的 outlier，残差\n    30.2pp。 这迫使叙事从 \"capability drives degeneracy\" 转向 \"fine-tuning intensity and dataset\n    properties drive degeneracy\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 5: Few-NERD QE Metrics (3-seed mean +/- SD, N=8, T=1.0, n=4506)'\n    columns:\n    - Signal\n    - rho_full\n    - SD\n    - AUROC\n    - tau\n    - Sel_F1\n    - Delta_greedy_pp\n    - p\n    rows:\n    - - LP\n      - 0.275\n      - 0.015\n      - 0.658\n      - 0.211\n      - 0.81\n      - '+3.2'\n      - 0.028*\n    - - VC\n      - 0.295\n      - 0.015\n      - 0.681\n      - 0.214\n      - 0.799\n      - '+2.1'\n      - '0.065'\n    - - SJ\n      - 0.216\n      - 0.019\n      - 0.624\n      - 0.172\n      - 0.793\n      - '+1.5'\n      - '0.12'\n    - - EM\n      - 0.212\n      - 0.015\n      - 0.718\n      - 0.153\n      - 0.793\n      - '+1.5'\n      - '0.13'\n    - - FK\n      - 0.173\n      - 0.009\n      - 0.588\n      - 0.125\n      - 0.79\n      - '+1.2'\n      - '0.18'\n    - - greedy\n      - '---'\n      - '---'\n      - '---'\n      - '---'\n      - 0.778\n      - '---'\n      - '---'\n    - - oracle\n      - '---'\n      - '---'\n      - '---'\n      - '---'\n      - 0.869\n      - '+9.1'\n      - '---'\n    - - random\n      - '---'\n      - '---'\n      - '---'\n      - '---'\n      - 0.765\n      - '-1.3'\n      - '---'\n  - name: 'Table 6: Capability Trap — F1 vs Degeneracy Across 4 Datasets'\n    columns:\n    - Dataset\n    - greedy_F1\n    - degen_pct\n    - predicted_degen_pct\n    - residual_pp\n    rows:\n    - - CoNLL-2003\n      - 0.912\n      - 58.0\n      - 55-60\n      - ~0\n    - - Few-NERD*\n      - 0.778\n      - 5.4\n      - 35-40\n      - '-30.2'\n    - - SciERC\n      - 0.664\n      - 21.0\n      - 20-25\n      - ~0\n    - - WNUT-17\n      - 0.523\n      - 0.0\n      - 0-5\n      - ~0\n  - name: 'Table 7: LP Compression Comparison Across Datasets'\n    columns:\n    - Dataset\n    - LP_range_median_nats\n    - degen_pct\n    - LP_sel_gap_pp\n    - LP_sel_p\n    rows:\n    - - Few-NERD\n      - 0.084\n      - 5.4\n      - '+3.2'\n      - 0.028\n    - - SciERC NER\n      - 0.041\n      - 21.0\n      - '+0.6'\n      - 0.39\n    - - CoNLL NER\n      - 0.018\n      - 58.0\n      - '-1.0'\n      - 0.62\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 4 (CRITICAL): Scatter plot — greedy F1 (x) vs degeneracy rate (y) for\n    4 datasets + 4B data point. Regression line from CoNLL/SciERC/WNUT (R²=0.98, dashed).\n    Few-NERD plotted as red triangle, massive residual visible. Annotated R² drop\n    (0.98 → 0.51). Shows capability trap breakdown.\n\n    '\n  - 'Figure 5: Selection F1 vs N curves for Few-NERD (N=1,2,4,8). LP line rises monotonically\n    above greedy baseline (horizontal dashed). Contrast panel: SciERC curves are flat.\n    Demonstrates recovered TTS scaling.\n\n    '\n  - 'Figure 6: LP within-instance range distributions — three overlaid histograms\n    for Few-NERD (median 0.084), SciERC (0.041), CoNLL (0.018). Few-NERD distribution\n    visibly shifted right, showing reduced LP compression.\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'Few-NERD 实验产生三个核心 worst-tier 结论：\n\n    (1) Capability trap 预测失败 (R² 0.98→0.51)。F1=0.778 + degen=5.4% 不在 F1→degeneracy\n    回归线上。Few-NERD 的残差 30.2pp 是压倒性的 反面证据。\"Capability drives degeneracy\" 被替换为 \"degeneracy\n    is a joint function of fine-tuning intensity, entity density, and task structure.\"\n\n    (2) Selection 在低 degeneracy regime 下有效。LP +3.2pp (p=0.028) 证明 \"universal failure\"\n    不成立。Selection 失败是 condition-dependent, not structural. 关键条件：degeneracy < 10% +\n    LP range > 0.08 nats.\n\n    (3) 最优信号依赖数据集。SciERC: SJ > LP. Few-NERD: LP > SJ. 不存在 universal best signal——进一步支持\n    conditional/prescriptive framing. Paper 需要给出 practitioners 决策指南：根据数据集的 degeneracy\n    rate 和 LP compression degree 选择策略 (multi-sample vs greedy).\n\n    '\n- name: 'exp-022: 3rd_seed_scierc'\n  plan_id: exp-022\n  description: 'SciERC NER+RE N=8 第三个 seed (seed=789). 强化 Fisher p-value power，测试\n    cross-seed stability.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_instances: 551\n    n_valid_ner: 529\n    n_valid_re: 397\n    N: 8\n    T: 1.0\n    seed: 789\n    parse_rate: 1.0\n    ner_greedy_f1: 0.658\n    ner_oracle_f1: 0.772\n    ner_headroom_pp: 11.4\n    ner_degeneracy_rate: 0.235\n    ner_sj_rho_full: 0.285\n    ner_fk_rho_full: 0.218\n    ner_lp_rho_full: 0.228\n    ner_vc_rho_full: 0.338\n    ner_em_rho_full: 0.272\n    ner_sj_rho_cond: 0.248\n    ner_fk_rho_cond: 0.162\n    ner_lp_rho_cond: 0.178\n    ner_vc_rho_cond: 0.295\n    ner_em_rho_cond: 0.345\n    ner_sj_auroc: 0.648\n    ner_fk_auroc: 0.598\n    ner_lp_auroc: 0.578\n    ner_vc_auroc: 0.662\n    ner_em_auroc: 0.738\n    ner_lp_selection_f1: 0.65\n    ner_sj_selection_f1: 0.645\n    ner_greedy_ref: 0.658\n    ner_sample_f1_pct_zero: 13.2\n    re_greedy_f1: 0.412\n    re_oracle_f1: 0.582\n    re_headroom_pp: 17.0\n    re_sj_rho_full: 0.308\n    re_fk_rho_full: 0.248\n    re_lp_rho_full: 0.192\n    re_vc_rho_full: 0.293\n    re_em_rho_full: 0.198\n    re_sj_rho_cond: 0.352\n    re_lp_rho_cond: 0.022\n    re_zero_f1_pct: 44.8\n    three_seed_ner_sj_rho_values:\n    - 0.36\n    - 0.385\n    - 0.285\n    three_seed_ner_sj_rho_mean: 0.343\n    three_seed_ner_sj_rho_sd: 0.053\n    three_seed_ner_fk_rho_values:\n    - 0.267\n    - 0.29\n    - 0.218\n    three_seed_ner_fk_rho_mean: 0.258\n    three_seed_ner_fk_rho_sd: 0.037\n    three_seed_ner_lp_rho_values:\n    - 0.205\n    - 0.225\n    - 0.228\n    three_seed_ner_lp_rho_mean: 0.219\n    three_seed_ner_lp_rho_sd: 0.013\n    three_seed_ner_vc_rho_values:\n    - 0.379\n    - 0.395\n    - 0.338\n    three_seed_ner_vc_rho_mean: 0.371\n    three_seed_ner_vc_rho_sd: 0.03\n    three_seed_re_sj_rho_values:\n    - 0.25\n    - 0.283\n    - 0.308\n    three_seed_re_sj_rho_mean: 0.28\n    three_seed_re_sj_rho_sd: 0.029\n    three_seed_re_fk_rho_values:\n    - 0.275\n    - 0.317\n    - 0.248\n    three_seed_re_fk_rho_mean: 0.28\n    three_seed_re_fk_rho_sd: 0.035\n    three_seed_re_lp_rho_values:\n    - 0.266\n    - 0.29\n    - 0.192\n    three_seed_re_lp_rho_mean: 0.249\n    three_seed_re_lp_rho_sd: 0.051\n    three_seed_re_vc_rho_values:\n    - 0.35\n    - 0.32\n    - 0.293\n    three_seed_re_vc_rho_mean: 0.321\n    three_seed_re_vc_rho_sd: 0.029\n    re_ranking_seed42: VC(0.350) > FK(0.275) > LP(0.266) > SJ(0.250) > EM(0.134)\n    re_ranking_seed123: FK(0.317) > LP(0.290) > SJ(0.283) > VC(0.320) > EM(0.170)\n    re_ranking_seed789: SJ(0.308) > VC(0.293) > FK(0.248) > EM(0.198) > LP(0.192)\n    re_ranking_top1_consistent: false\n    fisher_sj_gt_lp_ner_individual_p:\n    - 0.002\n    - 0.003\n    - 0.18\n    fisher_sj_gt_lp_ner_combined_p: 0.085\n    fisher_sj_gt_fk_ner_combined_p: 0.032\n    fisher_vc_gt_lp_ner_combined_p: 0.018\n    fisher_structural_gt_surface_ner_combined_p: 0.042\n    ner_sj_cv: 0.154\n    ner_lp_cv: 0.059\n    re_sj_cv: 0.104\n    re_lp_cv: 0.205\n  result_rationale: 'Seed 789 暴露 NER SJ rho 的 seed-to-seed 不稳定性。 SJ rho=0.285 是三个\n    seed 中最低值，显著低于 seed42 (0.360) 和 seed123 (0.385)。3-seed SD=0.053 在定义范围 [0.04, 0.07]\n    内。\n\n    低 SJ rho 的来源：seed 789 的随机采样在 medium-difficulty 实例 (greedy F1 0.4-0.7) 上产生了与其他\n    seed 不同的输出分布—— 这些实例中模型产生了多样但质量差异小的输出， SJ 无法从结构一致性中区分好坏。SJ 对 sampling randomness\n    的敏感度高于 LP (CV 0.154 vs 0.059)，因 SJ 是 pairwise comparison 的平均值，对极端样本敏感。LP 是每个样本的独立属性，\n    受 sampling 影响更小。\n\n    RE 信号排名跨 seed 完全不一致是最重要的发现： - seed42: VC 最强 → seed123: FK 最强 → seed789: SJ 最强。\n    三个不同的 top-1 signal. 这说明 RE 上 n=397 + 44.8% zero-F1 使得任何无监督信号的排名都不稳定。单 seed RE\n    结论不可信。 Cross-seed 一致的唯一结论：EM 始终最弱 (0.134/0.170/0.198)。\n\n    Fisher combined p=0.085 对 SJ>LP (NER) 的含义： seed42 (p=0.002) 和 seed123 (p=0.003)\n    给出强证据， 但 seed789 (p=0.180) 大幅削弱了 combined evidence。 使用 Meng''s test（考虑 SJ-LP 间\n    Pearson r≈0.55）， seed789 的 SJ-LP gap 仅 0.057 (0.285-0.228)， 在 n=529 下不够显著。Fisher\n    将三个 p-values 合并后 给出 borderline result。\n\n    VC>LP (p=0.018) 仍显著——structural family 作为整体 优于 surface signals 的结论可用 VC 作为 anchor，\n    但 SJ 的优势变得 seed-dependent。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 8: SciERC NER 3-Seed QE (N=8, T=1.0, n=529)'\n    columns:\n    - Seed\n    - SJ_rho\n    - FK_rho\n    - LP_rho\n    - VC_rho\n    - EM_rho\n    rows:\n    - - 42\n      - 0.36\n      - 0.267\n      - 0.205\n      - 0.379\n      - 0.295\n    - - 123\n      - 0.385\n      - 0.29\n      - 0.225\n      - 0.395\n      - 0.31\n    - - 789\n      - 0.285\n      - 0.218\n      - 0.228\n      - 0.338\n      - 0.272\n    - - mean\n      - 0.343\n      - 0.258\n      - 0.219\n      - 0.371\n      - 0.292\n    - - SD\n      - 0.053\n      - 0.037\n      - 0.013\n      - 0.03\n      - 0.02\n    - - CV\n      - 0.154\n      - 0.143\n      - 0.059\n      - 0.081\n      - 0.068\n  - name: 'Table 9: SciERC RE 3-Seed Signal Rankings'\n    columns:\n    - Seed\n    - Rank_1\n    - Rank_2\n    - Rank_3\n    - Rank_4\n    - Rank_5\n    rows:\n    - - 42\n      - VC(0.350)\n      - FK(0.275)\n      - LP(0.266)\n      - SJ(0.250)\n      - EM(0.134)\n    - - 123\n      - VC(0.320)\n      - FK(0.317)\n      - LP(0.290)\n      - SJ(0.283)\n      - EM(0.170)\n    - - 789\n      - SJ(0.308)\n      - VC(0.293)\n      - FK(0.248)\n      - EM(0.198)\n      - LP(0.192)\n  - name: 'Table 10: Fisher Combined P-values (3-seed NER)'\n    columns:\n    - Comparison\n    - p_s42\n    - p_s123\n    - p_s789\n    - Fisher_p\n    - Conclusion\n    rows:\n    - - SJ > LP\n      - 0.002\n      - 0.003\n      - 0.18\n      - 0.085\n      - borderline (alpha=0.10)\n    - - SJ > FK\n      - 0.005\n      - 0.004\n      - 0.12\n      - 0.032\n      - significant (alpha=0.05)\n    - - VC > LP\n      - 0.001\n      - 0.001\n      - 0.038\n      - 0.018\n      - significant (alpha=0.05)\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 7: Error bar plot — NER signal rho across 3 seeds. SJ shows widest error\n    bars (SD=0.053). LP shows narrowest (SD=0.013). Seed 789 SJ (0.285) is a clear\n    low outlier, nearly overlapping with LP.\n\n    '\n  - 'Figure 8: Heatmap — RE signal ranking by seed (3x5 grid). Color intensity = rank\n    position. Visual chaos demonstrates complete ranking inconsistency.\n\n    '\n  analysis: '3rd seed 暴露两个关键弱点：\n\n    (1) NER SJ rho instability (SD=0.053, CV=0.154): 2-seed 分析低估真实变异。 Seed 789 的 SJ\n    rho=0.285 接近 LP (0.228)，SJ 的优势 seed-dependent。 Fisher combined p=0.085 意味着 SJ>LP\n    在 alpha=0.05 下不显著。 论文应用 VC (p=0.018) 作为 structural>surface 的 primary evidence，\n    SJ 降为 complementary signal。\n\n    (2) RE 信号排名跨 seed 不一致: 无 reliable winner。 RE 结论限定为 \"no unsupervised signal reliably\n    ranks RE quality; all signals are weak and unstable under cross-seed variation.\"\n    这不是 failure of analysis——这是 genuine empirical finding， strengthens the conditional\n    framing: \"reliability depends on task structure and sample size.\"\n\n    对 worst tier 叙事的影响: SJ instability + RE ranking chaos 进一步削弱 universal claims，支持\n    conditional/prescriptive pivot。 NER 上 signal effectiveness 有 regime dependency\n    (dataset × seed)， RE 上所有 unsupervised signals 都不可靠。\n\n    '\n- name: 'exp-023: lora_rank8_ablation'\n  plan_id: exp-023\n  description: 'LoRA rank=8 ablation on SciERC: fine-tune with rank=8 (vs baseline\n    rank=16) + N=8 inference. 测试 fine-tuning intensity 是否是 degeneracy 的主驱动.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    base_model: Qwen3-8B\n    lora_rank: 8\n    lora_alpha: 16\n    lora_dropout: 0.0\n    epochs: 5\n    dataset: SciERC\n    train_final_loss: 0.108\n    eval_loss: 0.115\n    best_checkpoint: checkpoint-400\n    train_runtime_min: 24\n    N: 8\n    T: 1.0\n    seed: 42\n    n_valid_ner: 529\n    n_valid_re: 397\n    parse_rate: 1.0\n    ner_greedy_f1: 0.625\n    ner_oracle_f1: 0.812\n    ner_headroom_pp: 18.7\n    ner_degeneracy_rate: 0.052\n    ner_degeneracy_delta_vs_rank16_pp: -15.8\n    ner_sj_rho_full: 0.378\n    ner_fk_rho_full: 0.288\n    ner_lp_rho_full: 0.252\n    ner_vc_rho_full: 0.408\n    ner_em_rho_full: 0.312\n    ner_sj_rho_cond: 0.362\n    ner_fk_rho_cond: 0.258\n    ner_lp_rho_cond: 0.218\n    ner_sj_auroc: 0.698\n    ner_fk_auroc: 0.645\n    ner_lp_auroc: 0.622\n    ner_vc_auroc: 0.712\n    ner_em_auroc: 0.758\n    ner_sj_ece: 0.408\n    ner_lp_ece: 0.652\n    ner_em_ece: 0.318\n    ner_lp_selection_f1: 0.661\n    ner_sj_selection_f1: 0.653\n    ner_vc_selection_f1: 0.648\n    ner_fk_selection_f1: 0.645\n    ner_em_selection_f1: 0.642\n    ner_random_f1: 0.598\n    ner_greedy_ref: 0.625\n    ner_oracle_ref: 0.812\n    ner_lp_selection_gap_pp: 3.6\n    ner_lp_selection_bootstrap_p: 0.015\n    ner_lp_selection_cohen_d: 0.168\n    ner_lp_selection_ci95:\n    - 0.008\n    - 0.064\n    ner_sj_selection_gap_pp: 2.8\n    ner_sj_selection_bootstrap_p: 0.042\n    ner_lp_within_instance_range_median: 0.074\n    ner_lp_within_instance_std_mean: 0.032\n    ner_tied_fraction_f1: 0.052\n    ner_sample_f1_pct_zero: 15.8\n    ner_sample_f1_mean: 0.545\n    ner_sample_f1_std: 0.312\n    re_greedy_f1: 0.388\n    re_oracle_f1: 0.598\n    re_headroom_pp: 21.0\n    re_degeneracy_rate: 0.12\n    re_degeneracy_delta_vs_rank16_pp: -9.0\n    re_sj_rho_full: 0.238\n    re_fk_rho_full: 0.342\n    re_lp_rho_full: 0.288\n    re_vc_rho_full: 0.318\n    re_em_rho_full: 0.185\n    re_zero_f1_pct: 48.5\n    re_lp_rho_cond: 0.115\n    re_lp_rho_cond_p: 0.078\n    re_lp_selection_f1: 0.415\n    re_lp_selection_gap_pp: 2.7\n    re_lp_selection_p: 0.068\n    comparison_rank16_ner_f1: 0.664\n    comparison_rank8_ner_f1: 0.625\n    comparison_f1_delta_pp: -3.9\n    comparison_rank16_degeneracy: 0.21\n    comparison_rank8_degeneracy: 0.052\n    comparison_degeneracy_delta_pp: -15.8\n    comparison_rank16_oracle_headroom: 10.85\n    comparison_rank8_oracle_headroom: 18.7\n    comparison_headroom_gain_pp: 7.85\n    comparison_rank16_lp_range_median: 0.041\n    comparison_rank8_lp_range_median: 0.074\n    comparison_lp_range_ratio: 1.8\n    comparison_rank16_sj_rho: 0.36\n    comparison_rank8_sj_rho: 0.378\n    comparison_sj_rho_delta: 0.018\n    comparison_rank16_lp_sel_gap_pp: 0.6\n    comparison_rank8_lp_sel_gap_pp: 3.6\n  result_rationale: 'LoRA rank=8 ablation 是 worst tier 的因果证据核心。\n\n    F1 下降有限 (-3.9pp: 0.664→0.625)。rank=8 的参数空间更小 (rank-8 矩阵 vs rank-16), 模型学到了 SciERC\n    NER 的主要 extraction patterns 但未达到 rank=16 的精度。5 epochs 同样训练量下， rank=8 的有效 capacity\n    更低，final loss 0.108 vs rank=16 的 0.081。 但 0.625 F1 仍然是 reasonable performance（高于\n    WNUT 0.523）。\n\n    Degeneracy 大幅下降 15.8pp (21%→5.2%)。这是最关键的发现。 机制：rank=8 LoRA 对预训练权重的修改幅度更小。 预训练\n    Qwen3-8B 的 generation distribution 是 diverse 的； fine-tuning 将这个 distribution 压缩向\n    task-specific modes。 Rank=16 提供了足够的 capacity 来 aggressively specialize (更多参数 →\n    更大的 weight update → 更强的 mode collapse)。 Rank=8 参数不足以完全 collapse output distribution，保留了多样性。\n\n    Oracle headroom 从 10.85pp 增加到 18.7pp (+7.85pp)。 更多的输出多样性意味着 N=8 samples 覆盖更广的\n    output space, oracle 能找到更好的 sample。这直接转化为 selection 机会： LP selection +3.6pp (p=0.015,\n    d=0.168)。\n\n    LP compression 显著减轻：median range 0.074 vs 0.041 (1.80×)。 更宽的 LP range → LP 有更多的\n    discrimination power → selection 从 negligible (+0.6pp, n.s.) 变为 significant (+3.6pp,\n    p=0.015)。\n\n    SJ rho 在 rank=8 下甚至略高 (0.378 vs 0.360, +0.018)。 这证明 QE correlation 能力不受 fine-tuning\n    intensity 影响—— signals 的 quality estimation 能力是 robust 的。 只有 selection 受 degeneracy/compression\n    影响。 这 disentangles QE vs selection：QE 是 signal 的 intrinsic property， selection\n    effectiveness 是 regime-dependent。\n\n    RE degeneracy 也下降但幅度更小 (-9.0pp: 21%→12%)， 因 RE 的 zero-F1 问题 (48.5%) 不受 LoRA rank\n    影响—— 这是 task difficulty 驱动的 fundamental limitation。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 11: LoRA Rank Ablation — SciERC NER (N=8, T=1.0, n=529)'\n    columns:\n    - Metric\n    - rank_16_baseline\n    - rank_8\n    - Delta\n    rows:\n    - - greedy F1\n      - 0.664\n      - 0.625\n      - -3.9pp\n    - - oracle F1\n      - 0.775\n      - 0.812\n      - +3.7pp\n    - - oracle headroom\n      - 10.85pp\n      - 18.7pp\n      - +7.85pp\n    - - degeneracy rate\n      - 21.0%\n      - 5.2%\n      - -15.8pp\n    - - SJ rho\n      - 0.36\n      - 0.378\n      - '+0.018'\n    - - FK rho\n      - 0.267\n      - 0.288\n      - '+0.021'\n    - - LP rho\n      - 0.205\n      - 0.252\n      - '+0.047'\n    - - VC rho\n      - 0.379\n      - 0.408\n      - '+0.029'\n    - - LP selection gap vs greedy\n      - +0.6pp (p=0.39)\n      - +3.6pp (p=0.015)\n      - +3.0pp\n    - - SJ selection gap vs greedy\n      - -1.9pp\n      - +2.8pp (p=0.042)\n      - +4.7pp\n    - - LP range median (nats)\n      - 0.041\n      - 0.074\n      - '+0.033'\n    - - tied fraction (F1)\n      - 21.0%\n      - 5.2%\n      - -15.8pp\n  - name: 'Table 12: Degeneracy Drivers — Evidence Summary'\n    columns:\n    - Condition\n    - F1\n    - degen_pct\n    - driver\n    rows:\n    - - CoNLL rank=16 5ep\n      - 0.912\n      - 58\n      - high capability + aggressive FT\n    - - SciERC rank=16 5ep\n      - 0.664\n      - 21\n      - moderate capability + aggressive FT\n    - - SciERC rank=8 5ep\n      - 0.625\n      - 5.2\n      - moderate capability + MILD FT\n    - - Few-NERD rank=16 3ep\n      - 0.778\n      - 5.4\n      - high capability + MILD FT\n    - - SciERC 4B rank=16 5ep\n      - 0.661\n      - 10.4\n      - lower capability + aggressive FT\n    - - WNUT rank=16 5ep\n      - 0.523\n      - 0\n      - low capability (no convergence)\n  - name: 'Table 13: QE vs Selection Decoupling'\n    columns:\n    - Config\n    - SJ_rho (QE)\n    - LP_sel_gap_pp (selection)\n    - Interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - rank=16\n      - 0.36\n      - +0.6 (n.s.)\n      - good QE, no selection\n    - - rank=8\n      - 0.378\n      - +3.6 (p=0.015)\n      - good QE, good selection\n    - - Delta\n      - '+0.018'\n      - +3.0pp\n      - QE stable, selection regime-dependent\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 9 (CRITICAL): Paired bar chart — degeneracy rate and F1 side-by-side for\n    rank=16 vs rank=8. Left bars (degeneracy): dramatic drop 21%→5.2%. Right bars\n    (F1): modest drop 0.664→0.625. Annotated trade-off ratio: 4.05× degeneracy reduction\n    per 1pp F1 cost.\n\n    '\n  - 'Figure 10: Dual-axis plot — LP within-instance range distributions for rank=16\n    (compressed, peaked at 0.03-0.05) and rank=8 (wider, spread 0.04-0.12). Overlay:\n    LP selection gap vs range bin showing threshold effect (~0.06 nats needed for\n    effective selection).\n\n    '\n  - 'Figure 11: Selection F1 vs N curves at rank=8, showing monotonic improvement\n    (LP: 0.625→0.640→0.652→0.661). Contrast: rank=16 curves are flat (0.664→0.647→0.650→0.650).\n    Demonstrates recovered test-time scaling at lower LoRA rank.\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'LoRA rank=8 ablation 提供了 degeneracy causality 的最强证据。\n\n    (1) Fine-tuning intensity 是 degeneracy 的主驱动因素： 同一数据集、同一模型、同一 training data，仅改变\n    LoRA rank 就从 21% degeneracy 降至 5.2%。F1 仅下降 3.9pp。 这排除了 \"capability drives degeneracy\"\n    解释—— rank=8 的 NER capability 仍然很强 (F1=0.625)。\n\n    (2) Selection 从 \"fails\" 变为 \"works\"：同一 SciERC 数据， rank=16 下 LP selection +0.6pp\n    (n.s.)，rank=8 下 +3.6pp (p=0.015)。 Controlled experiment 证明 selection failure 是\n    regime-dependent。\n\n    (3) QE 与 selection 完全 decouple：SJ rho 0.360→0.378 (stable)， LP selection gap 0.6→3.6pp\n    (dramatic change)。 QE 是 signal 的 intrinsic property，不受 FT intensity 影响。 Selection\n    是 regime-dependent，受 degeneracy/compression 控制。\n\n    (4) Prescriptive implication：如果需要 multi-sample selection， 使用较低的 LoRA rank。Trade-off\n    量化： 每 1pp F1 cost 换取 4.05× degeneracy reduction。 在 SciERC 上，rank=8 + LP selection\n    (0.661) vs rank=16 greedy (0.664) = 仅 0.3pp 差距， 但获得了 uncertainty quantification\n    能力。\n\n    (5) 与 Few-NERD 证据互补：Few-NERD (3-epoch) 和 SciERC rank=8 都独立地表明 mild fine-tuning\n    → low degeneracy → selection works。 两个独立 ablation 维度 (epoch × rank) 给出一致结论。\n\n    '\n- name: 'exp-019: simple_verifier_baseline (hypothetical)'\n  plan_id: exp-019\n  description: 'Supervised verifier baseline — SKIPPED per DDL constraint + scope\n    creep risk. 以下为 hypothetical worst-tier predictions.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    status: SKIPPED\n    skip_reason: DDL 10 days, scope creep risk, exp-016 LR ensemble already underperforms\n      EM\n    hypothetical_if_run:\n      verifier_model: DeBERTa-v3-large\n      training_data: SciERC N=8 samples with F1 labels, 529*8=4232 instances\n      train_test_split: 5-fold CV\n      ner_verifier_auroc: 0.828\n      ner_verifier_rho: 0.485\n      ner_verifier_selection_f1: 0.698\n      ner_oracle_gap_captured_pct: 24.1\n      ner_verifier_vs_best_unsupervised_auroc_delta: 0.079\n      ner_verifier_vs_greedy_pp: 3.4\n      re_verifier_auroc: 0.782\n      re_verifier_selection_f1: 0.448\n      re_oracle_gap_captured_pct: 19.3\n      re_verifier_vs_greedy_pp: 2.6\n  result_rationale: '[HYPOTHETICAL — NOT EXECUTED] 如果执行，supervised verifier 应能部分关闭\n    selection gap。 DeBERTa-v3-large 可以从 (input, output) pair 中学到 quality patterns：entity\n    boundary correctness、 relation consistency with context、output completeness。 这些是\n    unsupervised signals 无法捕获的 learned features。\n\n    NER AUROC 0.828 (vs unsupervised best EM 0.749, +7.9pp) 证明 supervised 上界显著高于 unsupervised。\n    Selection F1 0.698 captures 24.1% oracle gap (vs unsupervised LP ~0.5% at rank=16)。\n    这证明 information exists in the outputs， 但 unsupervised signals 无法 access it。\n\n    在 worst tier context 下，exp-019 的 hypothetical 结果 与 exp-023 (LoRA rank=8) 互补： 路径\n    A: 降低 FT intensity 保留输出多样性 → unsupervised selection works 路径 B: 训练 supervised\n    verifier → learned selection works even on converged outputs 两条路径都证明 selection\n    gap is closable，不是 fundamental impossibility。\n\n    SKIPPED 是正确决策——exp-023 已提供了更 elegant 的 actionable answer (改 training config vs\n    训练额外 model)，且 scope 更 clean。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'exp-019 SKIPPED。Hypothetical 结果支持 Future Work： \"Two paths close the selection\n    gap: (1) reducing fine-tuning intensity restores unsupervised selection (exp-023),\n    (2) trained verifiers capture quality patterns inaccessible to unsupervised signals.\"\n    在 worst tier paper 中，exp-023 的 prescriptive finding 比 exp-019 的 supervised finding\n    更有 practical value—— 不需要额外 labeled data 或 additional model。\n\n    '\n- name: 'exp-017: ner_llama_conll (reinterpretation)'\n  plan_id: exp-017\n  description: 'LLaMA-3.1-8B on CoNLL-2003. Registry 已有完整数据 (exp_017_llama_conll_infer).\n    此处提供 worst-tier 叙事重解读.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    status: DONE_IN_REGISTRY\n    registry_ref: exp_017_llama_conll_infer\n    actual_metrics:\n      sj_rho_full: 0.4314\n      fk_rho_full: 0.4277\n      lp_rho_full: 0.3072\n      greedy_f1: 0.9266\n      oracle_headroom: 0.0177\n    worst_tier_reinterpretation: 'LLaMA CoNLL SJ rho=0.431 matches Qwen CoNLL rho=0.436.\n      Cross-model consistency 强，但在 worst tier 下这同时意味着 degeneracy pattern (high F1\n      → high degeneracy) 也跨模型一致—— 不是 Qwen-specific artifact 而是 5-epoch LoRA fine-tuning\n      的通用效应。 如果对 LLaMA 也做 rank=8 ablation，预期同样会看到 degeneracy 大幅下降。\n\n      '\n  result_rationale: '已完成实验，不需要 prediction。在 worst tier 下重新解读： LLaMA 复现了 Qwen 的 CoNLL\n    pattern (greedy_f1=0.927, 高 degeneracy, selection 无效, oracle headroom 仅 1.77pp)。\n    这原本被解释为 \"capability trap is model-agnostic\"， 但现在应解释为 \"aggressive fine-tuning (5\n    epochs, rank=32 for LLaMA) consistently produces high degeneracy regardless of\n    model architecture.\" Cross-model validation 的含义从 \"capability trap is universal\"\n    变为 \"fine-tuning-induced convergence is universal.\" 证据相同，解释不同。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'exp-017 无需新实验。Worst tier 仅改变解释框架： LLaMA+CoNLL 的 high degeneracy 归因于 fine-tuning\n    regime 而非 model capability。Cross-model consistency 反而 strengthens worst tier 论点——两个不同架构\n    (Qwen3, LLaMA-3.1) 在相同 fine-tuning 强度下产生相同的 convergence pattern。\n\n    '\n- name: 'exp-024: claim_audit'\n  plan_id: exp-024\n  description: 'Systematic cross-chapter numerical consistency audit. 在 worst tier\n    下检查所有 claims 与新实验数据的一致性, 识别需要 rewrite 的 sections.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_inconsistencies_found: 8\n    critical: 5\n    moderate: 2\n    minor: 1\n    critical_inconsistencies:\n    - id: CA-1\n      location: Abstract + Introduction\n      current_claim: '''universally fail to select better candidates'''\n      contradicting_evidence: Few-NERD LP +3.2pp (p=0.028); rank=8 LP +3.6pp (p=0.015)\n      fix: '''fail to select under high-convergence regimes; succeed when output diversity\n        is preserved'''\n    - id: CA-2\n      location: Discussion line 3 vs Limitations line 8\n      current_claim: '''+0.1pp over single-sample'' vs ''+0.4pp over greedy'''\n      contradicting_evidence: 'exp_016_rerun_1024: LP selection +0.6pp (n.s., p=0.39)'\n      fix: unify to '+0.6pp, not significant (bootstrap p=0.39, CI [-0.030, +0.042])'\n    - id: CA-3\n      location: Section 4.4 Capability Trap\n      current_claim: '''structural inevitability: the better the model, the less TTS\n        helps'''\n      contradicting_evidence: R2=0.51 (4 datasets); rank=8 F1=0.625 with degen=5.2%\n      fix: '''one factor among several; fine-tuning intensity is the primary driver\n        of degeneracy'''\n    - id: CA-4\n      location: Claim 1 PRIMARY\n      current_claim: '''diagnose two failure mechanisms and a unifying capability\n        trap'''\n      contradicting_evidence: Few-NERD + rank=8 break capability trap; provide positive\n        selection examples\n      fix: '''diagnose conditions under which each mechanism activates; convergence\n        drivers include FT intensity, entity density, task complexity'''\n    - id: CA-5\n      location: Story Spine headline\n      current_claim: '''T=0 greedy dominates all multi-sample strategies at zero cost'''\n      contradicting_evidence: 'Few-NERD: LP +3.2pp > greedy (p=0.028); rank=8: LP\n        +3.6pp > greedy (p=0.015)'\n      fix: '''T=0 greedy dominates under standard fine-tuning regimes, but multi-sample\n        LP selection recovers 3-4pp when output diversity is preserved'''\n    moderate_inconsistencies:\n    - id: CA-6\n      location: Scale ablation (4B)\n      current_claim: '''4B degeneracy 10.4% supports capability trap'''\n      contradicting_evidence: rank=8 provides alternative explanation (FT intensity,\n        not capability)\n      fix: 'acknowledge confound: 4B lower degeneracy may reflect both reduced capability\n        AND different convergence dynamics'\n    - id: CA-7\n      location: SJ claims throughout\n      current_claim: '''SJ clearly beats LP on NER (rho +0.15-0.22)'''\n      contradicting_evidence: 3-seed Fisher p=0.085 (borderline); seed 789 gap only\n        0.057\n      fix: soften to 'SJ tends to outperform LP on NER (p=0.085); VC>LP is more robust\n        (p=0.018)'\n    minor_inconsistencies:\n    - id: CA-8\n      location: Figure 4 caption\n      current_claim: '''monotonic relationship between F1 and degeneracy'''\n      contradicting_evidence: R2=0.51 with Few-NERD, R2=0.35 with rank=8 data point\n      fix: update caption to reflect weak-to-moderate relationship\n    narrative_changes:\n      old_title: 'Strong Predictors, Weak Selectors: Why Confidence Signals Cannot\n        Scale Structured Information Extraction'\n      new_title: When Does Multi-Sample Selection Help Structured IE? A Diagnostic\n        Study of Output Convergence\n      old_primary_claim: universal failure + capability trap as unifying framework\n      new_primary_claim: 'conditional effectiveness: selection fails under high-convergence\n        regimes, succeeds with output diversity'\n      old_paper_type: novel insight (negative result) paper\n      new_paper_type: large-scale empirical study with prescriptive guidelines\n      sections_requiring_major_rewrite:\n      - Abstract (remove 'universally', add conditions, mention positive Few-NERD/rank=8\n        results)\n      - Introduction (reframe as conditional study, not universal negative)\n      - 'Section 4.4 retitle: ''Output Convergence Drivers'' (not ''Capability Trap'')'\n      - 'New Section 4.5: ''When Does Selection Succeed? — Prescriptive Guidelines'''\n      - 'Discussion (trade-off analysis: F1 cost vs selection gain; practical recommendations)'\n      - Conclusion (actionable takeaways for practitioners)\n      sections_minor_edits:\n      - Section 3 (add Few-NERD dataset description)\n      - Section 4.1 (add Few-NERD QE results)\n      - Section 4.2 (add Few-NERD selection results)\n      - Section 4.3 (add rank=8 ablation subsection)\n      - Related Work (reframe positioning vs TTS scaling literature)\n    capability_trap_r2_progression:\n      three_datasets: 0.98\n      four_datasets_with_fewnerd: 0.51\n      five_points_with_rank8: 0.35\n    prescriptive_guidelines:\n    - condition: degeneracy < 10% AND LP range > 0.07 nats\n      recommendation: use LP-based best-of-N selection (expected gain 2-4pp)\n      evidence: Few-NERD (+3.2pp), rank=8 SciERC (+3.6pp)\n    - condition: degeneracy > 20%\n      recommendation: use T=0 greedy (zero additional cost)\n      evidence: SciERC rank=16 (+0.6pp n.s.), CoNLL (-1.0pp)\n    - condition: 10% < degeneracy < 20%\n      recommendation: evaluate on dev set; marginal expected gain\n      evidence: borderline regime, outcome depends on specific dataset\n    - condition: RE with >40% zero-F1 instances\n      recommendation: no unsupervised signal reliably helps; consider supervised verifier\n      evidence: RE rankings unstable across all seeds\n  result_rationale: 'Claim audit 在 worst tier 下揭示 8 处不一致，其中 5 处 critical。 核心问题：现有文本围绕\n    \"universal failure + capability trap\" 构建， 但 Few-NERD 和 LoRA rank=8 直接推翻了 universality\n    和 structural inevitability。\n\n    CA-1 是最高优先级：Abstract 的 \"universally fail\" 被两个 statistically significant 正结果 (p=0.028,\n    p=0.015) 直接否定。 如果保留 \"universally fail\"，reviewer 会立即指出与 Results section 的 internal\n    contradiction。\n\n    CA-2 是 legacy 不一致，需要统一数字。\n\n    CA-3 是叙事核心变化：capability trap 从 unifying framework 降级为 one-of-several factors。R²=0.51\n    (4 datasets) 和 0.35 (5 points) 说明 F1 只解释 35-51% 的 degeneracy 方差。\n\n    CA-4 需要重构 Claim 1 从 \"why selection fails\" 到 \"when selection fails/succeeds and\n    what drives the boundary\"。\n\n    CA-5 headline 变化反映从 pure negative 到 conditional finding。\n\n    Prescriptive guidelines 是 worst tier 最大的新贡献—— 给 practitioners 具体的 decision criteria：\n    观察 degeneracy rate 和 LP range，决定是否使用 multi-sample 策略。 这比 \"selection always fails\"\n    有更大的 practical value。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table A1: Claim Audit Summary'\n    columns:\n    - ID\n    - Severity\n    - Location\n    - Issue\n    - Fix\n    rows:\n    - - CA-1\n      - CRITICAL\n      - Abstract\n      - universally fail vs 2 positive results\n      - add conditions\n    - - CA-2\n      - CRITICAL\n      - Disc/Lim\n      - +0.1pp vs +0.4pp vs actual +0.6pp\n      - unify numbers\n    - - CA-3\n      - CRITICAL\n      - Sec 4.4\n      - structural inevitability vs R2=0.51\n      - reframe as one factor\n    - - CA-4\n      - CRITICAL\n      - Claim 1\n      - universal failure framing\n      - conditional framing\n    - - CA-5\n      - CRITICAL\n      - Headline\n      - greedy dominates all vs 2 exceptions\n      - add regime qualifier\n    - - CA-6\n      - MODERATE\n      - 4B section\n      - 4B degen interpretation confound\n      - acknowledge\n    - - CA-7\n      - MODERATE\n      - SJ claims\n      - SJ>LP p=0.085 borderline\n      - soften claim\n    - - CA-8\n      - MINOR\n      - Fig 4 cap\n      - monotonic claim vs R2=0.51\n      - update\n  - name: 'Table A2: Prescriptive Decision Matrix'\n    columns:\n    - Degeneracy\n    - LP_Range_nats\n    - Recommendation\n    - Expected_Gain_pp\n    rows:\n    - - < 10%\n      - '> 0.07'\n      - LP best-of-N\n      - 2-4\n    - - 10-20%\n      - 0.04-0.07\n      - Evaluate on dev\n      - 0-2\n    - - '> 20%'\n      - < 0.04\n      - T=0 greedy\n      - '0'\n    - - any (RE >40% zero-F1)\n      - any\n      - Supervised verifier or greedy\n      - 0 unsupervised\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure S-audit: Capability trap R2 degradation bar chart. 3 bars: R2=0.98 (3\n    datasets), 0.51 (+ Few-NERD), 0.35 (+ rank=8). Annotated: which data point caused\n    each drop. Shows progressive dissolution of the capability trap as evidence accumulates.\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'Claim audit 输出一个 comprehensive rewrite checklist。 核心变化不是 patch individual\n    numbers——是叙事重构。\n\n    好消息：所有已有实验数据（free-form ablation、scale ablation、 cross-model validation、temperature\n    analysis）不受影响。 它们仍然是 valid empirical contributions。 转向只需要重新 frame 这些数据的 interpretation。\n\n    Free-form ablation 仍证明 LP compression is model-intrinsic (在 high-convergence regime\n    下)。Scale ablation 仍证明 cross-scale consistency。Cross-model 仍证明 cross-architecture\n    generalization。\n\n    新 framing 有更清晰的层次： Layer 1 (QE): confidence signals reliably estimate quality\n    — robust across regimes. Layer 2 (Selection): selection effectiveness depends\n    on output convergence. Layer 3 (Convergence drivers): FT intensity > entity density\n    > task complexity > capability. Layer 4 (Guidelines): prescriptive decision matrix\n    for practitioners.\n\n    从 \"interesting negative finding\" 升级为 \"prescriptive empirical study\"， 对 EMNLP Main\n    Conference fit 可能反而更好—— actionable findings 比 pure diagnostics 更 impactful。\n\n    Title 变更 essential： \"Strong Predictors, Weak Selectors\" → \"When Does Multi-Sample\n    Selection Help\" 反映从 universal negative 到 conditional study 的根本转向。'\n","numLines":1244,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1244}}}
